// Banco de preguntas AZ-900 (160). Cada pregunta: id, type, question_en/es, options/options_es, correct, statements, pairs, explanation.
window.AZ900_QUESTIONS=[{"id":1,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Your company intends to subscribe to an Azure support plan. The support plan must allow for new support requests to be opened. Which of the following are support plans that will allow this? Answer by dragging the correct option from the list to the answer area.","question_es":"Tu empresa tiene intención de suscribirse a un plan de soporte de Azure. El plan de soporte debe permitir abrir nuevas solicitudes de soporte. ¿Cuáles de los siguientes planes permiten abrir solicitudes de soporte? Arrastra las opciones correctas al área de respuestas.","options":{"A":"Basic","B":"Developer","C":"Standard","D":"Professional Direct"},"options_es":{"A":"Basic","B":"Developer","C":"Standard","D":"Professional Direct"},"correct":["B","C","D"],"explanation":"Solo los planes Developer, Standard y Professional Direct permiten abrir solicitudes de soporte. El plan Basic no ofrece soporte técnico para abrir tickets."},{"id":2,"type":"single","question_en":"Your company plans to migrate all its virtual machines to an Azure pay-as-you-go subscription. The virtual machines are currently hosted on Hyper-V hosts in an on-premises data center. You need to ensure the intended Azure solution utilizes the appropriate expenditure model for cost management. Which expenditure model should you recommend?","question_es":"Tu empresa planea migrar todas sus máquinas virtuales a una suscripción de Azure de pago por uso (pay-as-you-go). Las máquinas virtuales están alojadas actualmente en hosts Hyper-V on-premise. Debes garantizar que la solución planeada utilice el modelo de gasto adecuado. ¿Qué modelo de gasto debes recomendar?","options":{"A":"Capital Expenditure (CapEx)","B":"Operational Expenditure (OpEx)","C":"Elastic Expenditure Model","D":"Reserved Instance Model"},"options_es":{"A":"Gasto de Capital (CapEx)","B":"Gasto Operativo (OpEx)","C":"Modelo de Gasto Elástico","D":"Modelo de Instancias Reservadas"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"El modelo OpEx coincide con pay-as-you-go, ya que pagas únicamente por lo que consumes sin inversión inicial. CapEx requiere gastos de capital altos, 'Elastic Expenditure Model' no existe como concepto oficial y las Instancias Reservadas requieren compromisos de 1 a 3 años."},{"id":3,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones, selecciona Sí si es verdadera. De lo contrario, selecciona No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"An Azure subscription can be associated to multiple Azure Active Directory (Azure AD) tenants.","statement_es":"Una suscripción de Azure puede estar asociada a múltiples tenants de Azure AD.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"You can change the Azure Active Directory (Azure AD) tenant to which an Azure subscription is associated.","statement_es":"Puedes cambiar el tenant de Azure AD al que está asociada una suscripción de Azure.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"When an Azure subscription expires, the associated Azure Active Directory (Azure AD) tenant is deleted automatically.","statement_es":"Cuando una suscripción de Azure expira, el tenant de Azure AD asociado se elimina automáticamente.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"Una suscripción solo puede estar asociada a un tenant a la vez. Es posible cambiar ese tenant. Cuando una suscripción expira, el tenant no se elimina automáticamente."},{"id":4,"type":"single","question_en":"Resource groups provide organizations with the ability to manage the compliance of Azure resources across multiple subscriptions. Evaluate the underlined text to determine if it is correct.","question_es":"Los grupos de recursos permiten a las organizaciones administrar el cumplimiento de los recursos de Azure en múltiples suscripciones. Evalúa el texto subrayado para determinar si es correcto.","options":{"A":"No change is needed","B":"Management groups","C":"Azure Policies","D":"Azure App Service plans"},"options_es":{"A":"No se necesita ningún cambio","B":"Grupos de administración","C":"Políticas de Azure","D":"Planes de App Service"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Los Resource Groups solo organizan recursos dentro de una suscripción. Los Management Groups permiten administrar cumplimiento, acceso y políticas en múltiples suscripciones."},{"id":5,"type":"multi","question_en":"Your company is migrating its infrastructure to Azure. Each department will have its own administrator and will manage its own Azure resources. Which two techniques can effectively segment Azure resources for these departments?","question_es":"Tu empresa está migrando su infraestructura a Azure. Cada departamento tendrá su propio administrador y gestionará sus propios recursos de Azure. ¿Qué dos técnicas pueden segmentar eficazmente los recursos de Azure para estos departamentos?","options":{"A":"Multiple subscriptions","B":"Multiple Azure AD directories","C":"Multiple regions","D":"Multiple resource groups"},"options_es":{"A":"Múltiples suscripciones","B":"Múltiples directorios de Azure AD","C":"Múltiples regiones","D":"Múltiples grupos de recursos"},"correct":["A","D"],"explanation":"Usar múltiples suscripciones permite aislamiento completo por departamento. Los grupos de recursos permiten segmentar recursos y delegar permisos dentro de cada suscripción. Múltiples directorios de Azure AD no es recomendado para segmentación interna y múltiples regiones no segmentan administración."},{"id":6,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones, selecciona Sí si la afirmación es verdadera. De lo contrario, selecciona No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"A single Microsoft account can be used to manage multiple Azure subscriptions.","statement_es":"Una sola cuenta de Microsoft puede usarse para administrar múltiples suscripciones de Azure.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Two Azure subscriptions can be merged into a single subscription.","statement_es":"Dos suscripciones de Azure pueden fusionarse en una sola suscripción.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"A company can use resources from multiple subscriptions.","statement_es":"Una empresa puede usar recursos de múltiples suscripciones.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"Una cuenta puede administrar múltiples suscripciones. No se pueden fusionar suscripciones. Una empresa sí puede usar recursos en múltiples suscripciones."},{"id":7,"type":"single","question_en":"You have several virtual machines in an Azure subscription. You create a new subscription. The virtual machines ____ be moved to the new subscription.","question_es":"Tienes varias máquinas virtuales en una suscripción de Azure. Creas una nueva suscripción. Las máquinas virtuales ____ ser movidas a la nueva suscripción.","options":{"A":"cannot be moved to the new subscription","B":"can be moved to the new subscription","C":"can be moved only if they are all in the same resource group","D":"can be moved only if they run Windows Server 2016"},"options_es":{"A":"no pueden ser movidas a la nueva suscripción","B":"pueden ser movidas a la nueva suscripción","C":"pueden ser movidas solo si están en el mismo grupo de recursos","D":"pueden ser movidas solo si ejecutan Windows Server 2016"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Las máquinas virtuales pueden moverse entre suscripciones siempre que estén en la misma región y el recurso soporte la operación 'Move'. No dependen del sistema operativo."},{"id":8,"type":"multi","question_en":"You have an Azure environment containing multiple virtual machines. You plan to implement a solution that enables client computers on your on-premises network to communicate with the Azure VMs. Which two Azure resources should you include in your recommendation? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.","question_es":"Tienes un entorno de Azure que contiene varias máquinas virtuales. Planeas implementar una solución que permita que los equipos cliente de tu red local se comuniquen con las máquinas virtuales de Azure. ¿Qué dos recursos de Azure deben incluirse en la recomendación? Cada respuesta correcta representa parte de la solución.","options":{"A":"A virtual network gateway","B":"A load balancer","C":"An application gateway","D":"A virtual network","E":"A gateway subnet"},"options_es":{"A":"Una puerta de enlace de red virtual","B":"Un equilibrador de carga","C":"Una puerta de enlace de aplicaciones","D":"Una red virtual","E":"Una subred de puerta de enlace"},"correct":["A","E"],"explanation":"Para conectar redes locales con Azure necesitas una virtual network gateway en combinación con una gateway subnet dedicada."},{"id":9,"type":"single","question_en":"You are attempting to create several managed SQL Server instances in Azure but receive a message indicating that you need to increase your subscription limits. What is the recommended approach to increase these limits?","question_es":"Estás intentando crear varias instancias administradas de SQL Server en Azure pero recibes un mensaje indicando que necesitas aumentar los límites de tu suscripción. ¿Cuál es el método recomendado para aumentar estos límites?","options":{"A":"Create a service health alert","B":"Upgrade your support plan","C":"Modify an Azure policy","D":"Create a new support request"},"options_es":{"A":"Crear una alerta de estado del servicio","B":"Actualizar tu plan de soporte","C":"Modificar una directiva de Azure","D":"Crear una nueva solicitud de soporte"},"correct":["D"],"explanation":"La forma correcta de incrementar límites de suscripción es crear una solicitud de soporte para que Microsoft revise y aumente los límites correspondientes."},{"id":11,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario, No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Availability zones can be implemented in all Azure regions.","statement_es":"Las Availability Zones pueden implementarse en todas las regiones de Azure.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Only virtual machines that run Windows Server can be created in availability zones.","statement_es":"Solo máquinas virtuales que ejecutan Windows Server pueden crearse en Availability Zones.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Availability zones are used to replicate data and applications to multiple regions.","statement_es":"Las Availability Zones se usan para replicar datos y aplicaciones a múltiples regiones.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"No todas las regiones tienen AZs. No están limitadas a Windows Server. Las AZs proporcionan redundancia dentro de una sola región, no entre regiones."},{"id":12,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You plan to create an Azure virtual machine. You need to identify which storage service must be used to store the unmanaged data disks of the virtual machine.","question_es":"Planeas crear una máquina virtual de Azure. Necesitas identificar qué servicio de almacenamiento se debe usar para almacenar los discos de datos no administrados de la máquina virtual.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Storage service for unmanaged VM disks","statement_es":"Servicio de almacenamiento para discos no administrados","correct":"Azure Blob Storage (Page Blobs)"}],"explanation":"Los discos no administrados se almacenan como page blobs dentro de una cuenta de almacenamiento de Azure."},{"id":13,"type":"single","question_en":"Your company plans to migrate all virtual machines to an Azure pay-as-you-go subscription. The VMs are currently hosted on Hyper-V hosts in an on-premises data center. To ensure cost optimization, which expenditure model should you recommend?","question_es":"Tu empresa planea migrar todas las máquinas virtuales a una suscripción de Azure de pago por uso (pay-as-you-go). Actualmente las máquinas virtuales están alojadas en hosts Hyper-V on-premise. ¿Qué modelo de gasto debes recomendar para optimizar costos?","options":{"A":"Scalable expenditure model","B":"Capital expenditure (CapEx) model","C":"Operational expenditure (OpEx) model","D":"Reserved Instances"},"options_es":{"A":"Modelo de gasto escalable","B":"Gasto de capital (CapEx)","C":"Gasto operativo (OpEx)","D":"Instancias reservadas"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"El modelo OpEx coincide con pay-as-you-go, ya que pagas únicamente por lo que consumes sin inversiones iniciales. CapEx requiere desembolso inicial y las instancias reservadas requieren compromisos a largo plazo."},{"id":14,"type":"single","question_en":"Your company plans to migrate several servers to Azure. A compliance policy dictates that a server named FinServer must reside on a separate network segment. Which Azure solution should you recommend to ensure network segmentation?","question_es":"Tu empresa planea migrar varios servidores a Azure. Una política de cumplimiento exige que un servidor llamado FinServer resida en un segmento de red separado. ¿Qué solución de Azure debes recomendar para garantizar la segmentación de red?","options":{"A":"A resource group for FinServer and another resource group for all the other servers","B":"A virtual network for FinServer and another virtual network for all the other servers","C":"A VPN for FinServer and a virtual network gateway for each other server","D":"One resource group for all the servers and a resource lock for FinServer"},"options_es":{"A":"Un grupo de recursos para FinServer y otro para los demás servidores","B":"Una red virtual para FinServer y otra para los demás servidores","C":"Una VPN para FinServer y una puerta de enlace para cada otro servidor","D":"Un grupo de recursos para todos los servidores y un resource lock para FinServer"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Las VNets permiten segmentación completa de red. Los resource groups no proporcionan aislamiento de red, y las VPN no segmentan internamente los servidores."},{"id":15,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to create a storage solution in Azure for mapping a network drive from several Windows 10 computers to Azure Storage. What type of Azure resource should you create?","question_es":"Necesitas crear una solución de almacenamiento en Azure para mapear una unidad de red desde varias computadoras Windows 10 hacia Azure Storage. ¿Qué tipo de recurso de Azure debes crear?","options":{"A":"An Azure SQL database","B":"A virtual machine data disk","C":"A File service in a storage account","D":"A Blob service in a storage account"},"options_es":{"A":"Una base de datos SQL de Azure","B":"Un disco de datos de máquina virtual","C":"Un servicio de archivos en una cuenta de almacenamiento","D":"Un servicio Blob en una cuenta de almacenamiento"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure Files permite crear file shares accesibles mediante SMB, ideales para mapear unidades de red desde Windows 10. SQL Database, discos de VM y Blob Storage no cumplen este propósito."},{"id":16,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You plan to implement an Azure database solution. You need a database service that can add data concurrently from multiple regions and can store JSON documents. Which database service should you deploy?","question_es":"Planeas implementar una solución de base de datos en Azure. Necesitas un servicio que pueda agregar datos de forma concurrente desde múltiples regiones y almacenar documentos JSON. ¿Qué servicio de base de datos debes implementar?","statements":[{"statement_en":"Database service that meets the requirements","statement_es":"Servicio de base de datos que cumple los requisitos","correct":"Azure Cosmos DB"}],"explanation":"Azure Cosmos DB es la base de datos distribuida globalmente de Azure que permite escrituras desde múltiples regiones y almacenamiento nativo de documentos JSON."},{"id":17,"type":"single","question_en":"Your organization intends to migrate its entire network infrastructure to Azure. As a first step, you need to explore Azure's capabilities. What is the initial resource you should create to begin this exploration?","question_es":"Tu organización planea migrar toda su infraestructura de red a Azure. Como primer paso, necesitas explorar las capacidades de Azure. ¿Cuál es el primer recurso que debes crear para iniciar esta exploración?","options":{"A":"A subscription","B":"A resource group","C":"A virtual network","D":"A management group"},"options_es":{"A":"Una suscripción","B":"Un grupo de recursos","C":"Una red virtual","D":"Un grupo de administración"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Una suscripción es necesaria para crear cualquier recurso en Azure. Sin ella, no puedes crear grupos de recursos, redes virtuales ni administrar políticas."},{"id":19,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Data that is stored in the Archive access tier of an Azure Storage account ____.","question_es":"Los datos almacenados en el nivel de acceso Archive de una cuenta de Azure Storage ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"must be rehydrated before the data can be accessed.","statement_es":"deben rehidratarse antes de poder accederse.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["can be accessed at any time using azcopy.exe","can only be read using Azure Backup","must be restored before the data can be accessed","must be rehydrated before the data can be accessed"],"explanation":"Los datos en Archive se mantienen offline. Para leerlos o descargarlos deben rehidratarse primero hacia un nivel en línea como Hot o Cool. Esto puede tardar varias horas."},{"id":20,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You need to deploy a critical line-of-business application to Azure with a guaranteed availability of 99.99 percent. What is the minimum number of virtual machines and availability zones required?","question_es":"Necesitas implementar una aplicación crítica en Azure con una disponibilidad garantizada del 99.99 por ciento. ¿Cuál es el número mínimo de máquinas virtuales y de zonas de disponibilidad requeridas?","statements":[{"statement_en":"Minimum number of virtual machines","statement_es":"Número mínimo de máquinas virtuales","correct":"2"},{"statement_en":"Minimum number of availability zones","statement_es":"Número mínimo de zonas de disponibilidad","correct":"2"}],"explanation":"Para alcanzar 99.99% de disponibilidad con máquinas virtuales se requieren al menos dos VMs distribuidas en dos zonas de disponibilidad diferentes."},{"id":21,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service is MOST suitable for collecting events from multiple Azure resources into a centralized repository for real-time processing and analysis?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure es MÁS adecuado para recopilar eventos de múltiples recursos de Azure en un repositorio centralizado para análisis y procesamiento en tiempo real?","options":{"A":"Azure Event Hubs","B":"Azure Analysis Services","C":"Azure Monitor","D":"Azure Stream Analytics"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Event Hubs","B":"Azure Analysis Services","C":"Azure Monitor","D":"Azure Stream Analytics"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Event Hubs está diseñado para ingesta de eventos de alto rendimiento y procesamiento en tiempo real. Azure Monitor se centra en telemetría, Stream Analytics procesa flujos y Analysis Services no ingresa eventos."},{"id":22,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Complete the sentence: An Availability Zone in Azure is a physical location _____.","question_es":"Completa la oración: Una Zona de Disponibilidad en Azure es una ubicación física _____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"An Availability Zone is a physical location within an Azure region.","statement_es":"Una Zona de Disponibilidad es una ubicación física dentro de una región de Azure.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"Las Zonas de Disponibilidad son ubicaciones físicas independientes dentro de la misma región de Azure, con energía, enfriamiento y redes separadas."},{"id":23,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario, selecciona No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Data that is stored in an Azure Storage account automatically has at least three copies.","statement_es":"Los datos almacenados en una cuenta de Azure Storage automáticamente tienen al menos tres copias.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"All data copied to an Azure Storage account is automatically backed up to another Azure datacenter.","statement_es":"Todos los datos copiados a una cuenta de Azure Storage se respaldan automáticamente en otro centro de datos de Azure.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"An Azure Storage account can contain up to 102 TB of data and up to one million files.","statement_es":"Una cuenta de Azure Storage puede contener hasta 102 TB de datos y hasta un millón de archivos.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"Con LRS se crean tres copias dentro de una misma región. El respaldo entre regiones solo ocurre con GRS. Los límites actuales de almacenamiento son mucho mayores que 102 TB."},{"id":24,"type":"single","question_en":"Your company plans to migrate all virtual machines to an Azure pay-as-you-go subscription. Which expenditure model aligns with this type of subscription?","question_es":"Tu empresa planea migrar todas las máquinas virtuales a una suscripción de Azure de pago por uso. ¿Qué modelo de gasto se alinea con este tipo de suscripción?","options":{"A":"Operational Expenditure (OpEx)","B":"Capital Expenditure (CapEx)","C":"Subscription-based Expenditure (SubEx)","D":"Hybrid Expenditure (HyEx)"},"options_es":{"A":"Gasto operativo (OpEx)","B":"Gasto de capital (CapEx)","C":"Gasto basado en suscripción (SubEx)","D":"Gasto híbrido (HyEx)"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"OpEx es el modelo que se alinea con el pago por uso, ya que se paga por los recursos consumidos sin inversión inicial. CapEx requiere inversión inicial y SubEx/HyEx no son modelos oficiales."},{"id":25,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"If you have Azure resources deployed to every region, you can implement Availability Zones in all regions.","statement_es":"Si tienes recursos de Azure desplegados en todas las regiones, puedes implementar Availability Zones en todas ellas.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Only virtual machines that run Windows Server can be created in Availability Zones.","statement_es":"Solo las máquinas virtuales que ejecutan Windows Server pueden crearse en Availability Zones.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Availability Zones are used to replicate data and applications to multiple regions.","statement_es":"Las Availability Zones se usan para replicar datos y aplicaciones entre múltiples regiones.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"No todas las regiones admiten Availability Zones y no están limitadas a Windows. La respuesta 'Yes' del tercer ítem proviene del PDF aunque es técnicamente discutible."},{"id":27,"type":"single","question_en":"You plan to deploy several Azure virtual machines. You need to ensure that the services running on the virtual machines are available if a single datacenter fails. Solution: You deploy the virtual machines to two or more scale sets. Does this meet the goal?","question_es":"Planeas implementar varias máquinas virtuales en Azure. Debes garantizar que los servicios continúen disponibles si un solo centro de datos falla. Solución: implementas las máquinas virtuales en dos o más scale sets. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Los scale sets no garantizan resiliencia ante fallas de un centro de datos. Para lograrlo se requieren Availability Zones o Availability Sets."},{"id":28,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to be notified when Microsoft plans to perform maintenance that could affect the resources deployed to an Azure subscription. Which Azure service should you use?","question_es":"Necesitas recibir notificaciones cuando Microsoft planea realizar mantenimiento que podría afectar los recursos implementados en una suscripción de Azure. ¿Qué servicio de Azure debes usar?","options":{"A":"Azure Monitor","B":"Azure Service Health","C":"Azure Advisor","D":"Microsoft Trust Center"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Monitor","B":"Azure Service Health","C":"Azure Advisor","D":"Microsoft Trust Center"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Azure Service Health proporciona notificaciones sobre mantenimiento planificado e incidentes que pueden afectar tus recursos."},{"id":29,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match each Azure IoT service to its proper description.","question_es":"Relaciona cada servicio IoT de Azure con su descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"A managed service that provides bidirectional communication between IoT devices and Azure.","description_es":"Un servicio administrado que proporciona comunicación bidireccional entre dispositivos IoT y Azure.","correct":"IoT Hub"},{"description_en":"A fully managed SaaS solution to connect, monitor, and manage IoT devices at scale.","description_es":"Una solución SaaS completamente administrada para conectar, supervisar y administrar dispositivos IoT a escala.","correct":"IoT Central"},{"description_en":"A software and hardware solution that provides communication and security features for IoT devices.","description_es":"Una solución de software y hardware que proporciona características de comunicación y seguridad para dispositivos IoT.","correct":"Azure Sphere"}],"explanation":"IoT Hub maneja comunicación, IoT Central es una solución SaaS completa, y Azure Sphere proporciona seguridad basada en hardware y software."},{"id":31,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements about Windows Virtual Desktop, select Yes if true; otherwise No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones sobre Windows Virtual Desktop, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario, No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"A Windows Virtual Desktop session host can run Windows 10 only.","statement_es":"Un host de sesión de Windows Virtual Desktop solo puede ejecutar Windows 10.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"A Windows Virtual Desktop host pool that includes 20 session hosts supports a maximum of 20 simultaneous user connections.","statement_es":"Un host pool de Windows Virtual Desktop con 20 session hosts soporta un máximo de 20 conexiones simultáneas.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Windows Virtual Desktop supports desktop and app virtualization.","statement_es":"Windows Virtual Desktop admite virtualización de escritorios y aplicaciones.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"AVD puede ejecutar Windows 10, 11 y Windows Server. La capacidad de usuarios no está limitada al número de hosts y sí soporta virtualización de escritorio y aplicaciones."},{"id":32,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You can calculate cost savings due to reduced electricity consumption as a result of migrating on-premises Microsoft SQL servers to Azure. Which tool should you use?","question_es":"Puedes calcular el ahorro en costos debido a la reducción del consumo eléctrico al migrar servidores Microsoft SQL on-premises a Azure. ¿Qué herramienta deberías usar?","statements":[{"statement_en":"Tool used to calculate cost savings due to reduced electricity consumption","statement_es":"Herramienta utilizada para calcular ahorros por reducción de consumo eléctrico","correct":"Azure Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) Calculator"}],"explanation":"La calculadora TCO estima ahorros comparando infraestructura local con Azure, incluyendo electricidad, hardware y mantenimiento."},{"id":34,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to deploy an Artificial Intelligence (AI) solution on Azure. Your primary goal is to build, test, and deploy predictive analytics capabilities. Which Azure service is MOST appropriate?","question_es":"Necesitas implementar una solución de inteligencia artificial (IA) en Azure. Tu objetivo principal es crear, probar y desplegar capacidades de análisis predictivo. ¿Qué servicio es el más adecuado?","options":{"A":"Azure Cosmos DB","B":"Azure Virtual Machines","C":"Azure Machine Learning","D":"Azure Blob Storage"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Cosmos DB","B":"Máquinas virtuales de Azure","C":"Azure Machine Learning","D":"Azure Blob Storage"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure Machine Learning está diseñado para construir, entrenar y desplegar modelos de análisis predictivo. Cosmos DB, VMs y Blob Storage no ofrecen capacidades nativas de ML."},{"id":36,"type":"multi","question_en":"You plan to deploy several Azure virtual machines and need to ensure the services running on them remain available if a single datacenter fails. Which two solutions should you implement?","question_es":"Planeas implementar varias máquinas virtuales y necesitas asegurar que los servicios permanezcan disponibles si un centro de datos falla. ¿Qué dos soluciones deberías implementar?","options":{"A":"Deploy the virtual machines to two or more availability zones.","B":"Deploy the virtual machines to two or more resource groups.","C":"Deploy the virtual machines to a scale set.","D":"Deploy the virtual machines to two or more regions."},"options_es":{"A":"Implementar las máquinas virtuales en dos o más zonas de disponibilidad.","B":"Implementar las máquinas virtuales en dos o más grupos de recursos.","C":"Implementar las máquinas virtuales en un scale set.","D":"Implementar las máquinas virtuales en dos o más regiones."},"correct":["A","D"],"explanation":"Las zonas de disponibilidad protegen contra fallas de datacenter dentro de una región. Implementar en múltiples regiones agrega resiliencia geográfica. Los resource groups no proveen alta disponibilidad y los scale sets solo proveen escalabilidad."},{"id":37,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"To ensure that a virtual machine named VM1 cannot connect to the other virtual machines, VM1 must ____.","question_es":"Para asegurarte de que una máquina virtual llamada VM1 no pueda conectarse a las otras máquinas virtuales, VM1 debe ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"VM1 must be deployed to a separate virtual network.","statement_es":"VM1 debe implementarse en una red virtual separada.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["be deployed to a separate virtual network","run a different operating system","be deployed to a separate resource group","have two network interfaces"],"explanation":"Las máquinas virtuales dentro de la misma VNet pueden comunicarse entre sí por defecto. Para aislarlas, deben estar en VNets distintas."},{"id":38,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the Azure service to the appropriate description.","question_es":"Relaciona el servicio de Azure con su descripción correspondiente.","pairs":[{"description_en":"A globally distributed database service that supports NoSQL.","description_es":"Una base de datos distribuida globalmente que soporta NoSQL.","correct":"Azure Cosmos DB"},{"description_en":"A serverless compute service that triggers code execution.","description_es":"Un servicio de cómputo serverless que ejecuta código mediante disparadores.","correct":"Azure Functions"},{"description_en":"A service that delivers content to users with low latency.","description_es":"Un servicio que entrega contenido a los usuarios con baja latencia.","correct":"Azure CDN"},{"description_en":"A fully managed relational database-as-a-service.","description_es":"Una base de datos relacional totalmente administrada como servicio.","correct":"Azure SQL Database"}],"explanation":"Cosmos DB es NoSQL distribuida; Functions es serverless; CDN entrega contenido con baja latencia; SQL Database es relacional y administrada."},{"id":41,"type":"single","question_en":"What is the most significant failure scenario against which Azure Availability Zones are designed to protect access to Azure services?","question_es":"¿Contra cuál es el escenario de falla más significativo que están diseñadas a proteger las Azure Availability Zones?","options":{"A":"A physical server failure","B":"An Azure region failure","C":"A storage failure","D":"An Azure datacenter failure"},"options_es":{"A":"Una falla de servidor físico","B":"Una falla de región de Azure","C":"Una falla de almacenamiento","D":"Una falla de un centro de datos de Azure"},"correct":["D"],"explanation":"Azure Availability Zones están diseñadas para proteger contra la caída completa de un datacenter dentro de una región. No protegen contra fallas regionales."},{"id":42,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to acquire a third-party virtual security appliance for deployment within an Azure subscription. Where can you find and purchase this appliance?","question_es":"Necesitas adquirir un appliance virtual de seguridad de terceros para implementarlo en una suscripción de Azure. ¿Dónde puedes encontrarlo y comprarlo?","options":{"A":"Azure Subscriptions","B":"Azure Security Center","C":"Azure Marketplace","D":"Microsoft Store"},"options_es":{"A":"Suscripciones de Azure","B":"Azure Security Center","C":"Azure Marketplace","D":"Microsoft Store"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure Marketplace ofrece appliances virtuales de seguridad y soluciones de terceros listas para desplegarse en Azure."},{"id":43,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the serverless solution to the correct characteristic.","question_es":"Relaciona la solución serverless con su característica correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Executes code","description_es":"Ejecuta código","correct":"Azure Functions"},{"description_en":"Is always stateful","description_es":"Siempre es stateful","correct":"Azure Logic Apps"},{"description_en":"Runs only in the cloud","description_es":"Funciona únicamente en la nube","correct":"Azure Logic Apps"}],"explanation":"Azure Functions ejecuta código serverless. Azure Logic Apps es stateful y se ejecuta exclusivamente como servicio en la nube."},{"id":44,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the Azure governance feature to the correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona la característica de gobernanza de Azure con su descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Prevents resources from being accidentally deleted.","description_es":"Evita que los recursos se eliminen accidentalmente.","correct":"Resource Locks"},{"description_en":"Ensures resources comply with organizational standards.","description_es":"Garantiza que los recursos cumplan los estándares organizacionales.","correct":"Azure Policy"},{"description_en":"Controls who can access resources and what actions they can perform.","description_es":"Controla quién puede acceder a los recursos y qué acciones pueden realizar.","correct":"RBAC"}],"explanation":"Locks protegen contra eliminaciones accidentales, Policy asegura cumplimiento y RBAC regula permisos y acciones disponibles."},{"id":45,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match each Azure governance feature to the correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona cada característica de gobernanza de Azure con su descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Restrict which virtual machine types can be created in a subscription","description_es":"Restringe qué tipos de máquinas virtuales pueden crearse en una suscripción","correct":"Azure Policy"},{"description_en":"Deploy a complete Azure application environment including resource configurations and role assignments","description_es":"Implementa un entorno completo de aplicación en Azure, incluyendo configuraciones de recursos y asignaciones de roles","correct":"Azure Blueprints"},{"description_en":"Associate metadata with Azure resources","description_es":"Asocia metadatos con recursos de Azure","correct":"Azure Tags"},{"description_en":"Prevent resources from being accidentally deleted","description_es":"Evita que los recursos sean eliminados accidentalmente","correct":"Azure Resource Locks"}],"explanation":"Policy controla qué se crea; Blueprints implementan arquitecturas completas; Tags agregan metadatos; Locks evitan eliminación o cambios."},{"id":46,"type":"single","question_en":"To reduce impact during migration, you plan to sync all Active Directory user accounts to Azure AD. Does this meet the stated goal?","question_es":"Para reducir el impacto durante la migración, planeas sincronizar todas las cuentas de Active Directory con Azure AD. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Sincronizar las cuentas con Azure AD minimiza el impacto en los usuarios al mantener sus credenciales existentes mediante Azure AD Connect."},{"id":47,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the Azure service to the correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona el servicio de Azure con su descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Provide operating system virtualization","description_es":"Proveen virtualización del sistema operativo","correct":"Azure Virtual Machines"},{"description_en":"Provide a portable environment for containerized applications","description_es":"Proporcionan un entorno portátil para aplicaciones en contenedores","correct":"Azure Container Instances"},{"description_en":"Used to build, deploy, and scale web apps","description_es":"Se utiliza para crear, implementar y escalar aplicaciones web","correct":"Azure App Service"},{"description_en":"Provide serverless compute triggered by events","description_es":"Proporcionan cómputo serverless ejecutado por eventos","correct":"Azure Functions"}],"explanation":"VMs ofrecen virtualización del SO; ACI ejecuta contenedores; App Service es plataforma de web apps; Functions ejecuta código serverless basado en eventos."},{"id":49,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to deploy a third-party virtual security appliance within your Azure subscription. Which Azure service should you use?","question_es":"Debes implementar un appliance virtual de seguridad de un tercero dentro de tu suscripción de Azure. ¿Qué servicio debes utilizar?","options":{"A":"Azure Subscriptions","B":"Microsoft Defender for Cloud","C":"Azure Marketplace","D":"Microsoft Store"},"options_es":{"A":"Suscripciones de Azure","B":"Microsoft Defender for Cloud","C":"Azure Marketplace","D":"Microsoft Store"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"El Azure Marketplace es el catálogo oficial para adquirir soluciones y appliances de terceros listos para desplegar en Azure."},{"id":50,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"_____ is a highly secure IoT solution that includes a microcontroller unit (MCU) and a custom Linux-based operating system.","question_es":"_____ es una solución IoT altamente segura que incluye una unidad microcontroladora (MCU) y un sistema operativo Linux personalizado.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Azure Sphere","statement_es":"Azure Sphere","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Azure Arc","Azure IoT Central","Azure IoT Hub","Azure Sphere"],"explanation":"Azure Sphere combina hardware seguro, un SO Linux endurecido y un servicio de seguridad en la nube para proteger dispositivos IoT."},{"id":52,"type":"single","question_en":"You plan to deploy a critical service to Azure virtual machines and need to ensure high availability even if an entire Azure datacenter fails. Which Azure feature is most suitable?","question_es":"Planeas implementar un servicio crítico en máquinas virtuales de Azure y necesitas garantizar disponibilidad incluso si falla un centro de datos completo. ¿Qué característica de Azure es la más adecuada?","options":{"A":"Availability Sets","B":"Proximity Placement Groups","C":"Host Groups","D":"Availability Zones"},"options_es":{"A":"Availability Sets","B":"Proximity Placement Groups","C":"Host Groups","D":"Availability Zones"},"correct":["D"],"explanation":"Las Availability Zones proporcionan aislamiento físico completo entre datacenters dentro de una región, ofreciendo la mayor protección ante la caída de un datacenter."},{"id":53,"type":"single","question_en":"To restrict administrators to creating resources only in specific approved regions, which Azure service should you implement?","question_es":"Para restringir a los administradores a crear recursos solo en regiones aprobadas, ¿qué servicio de Azure debes implementar?","options":{"A":"A read-only lock","B":"An Azure policy","C":"A management group","D":"A reservation"},"options_es":{"A":"Un bloqueo de solo lectura","B":"Una Azure Policy","C":"Un management group","D":"Una reserva"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Azure Policy permite restringir explícitamente las regiones donde se pueden crear recursos, garantizando cumplimiento y gobernanza."},{"id":54,"type":"single","question_en":"You plan to create a solution that automatically scales compute resources based on demand. Which Azure service should you use?","question_es":"Planeas crear una solución que escale automáticamente recursos de cómputo basado en la demanda. ¿Qué servicio debes usar?","options":{"A":"Azure Virtual Machines","B":"Azure App Service","C":"Azure Kubernetes Service","D":"Azure Virtual Machine Scale Sets"},"options_es":{"A":"Máquinas virtuales de Azure","B":"Azure App Service","C":"Azure Kubernetes Service","D":"Azure Virtual Machine Scale Sets"},"correct":["D"],"explanation":"Los Scale Sets permiten escalar automáticamente máquinas virtuales basándose en métricas o demanda del sistema."},{"id":55,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement, select Yes if the statement is true; otherwise No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"You can control access to Azure resources by assigning roles to users.","statement_es":"Puedes controlar el acceso a recursos de Azure mediante la asignación de roles a los usuarios.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"You can use resource groups to organize Azure AD users.","statement_es":"Puedes usar grupos de recursos para organizar usuarios de Azure AD.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Azure AD groups can contain users and devices.","statement_es":"Los grupos de Azure AD pueden contener usuarios y dispositivos.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"RBAC permite controlar permisos. Los resource groups no organizan usuarios. Azure AD admite grupos que contienen usuarios y dispositivos."},{"id":56,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service provides recommendations on how to reduce costs?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure proporciona recomendaciones sobre cómo reducir costos?","options":{"A":"Azure Monitor","B":"Azure Service Health","C":"Azure Advisor","D":"Azure Security Center"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Monitor","B":"Azure Service Health","C":"Azure Advisor","D":"Azure Security Center"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure Advisor entrega recomendaciones personalizadas para reducir costos, mejorar seguridad, rendimiento y confiabilidad."},{"id":58,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure feature defines performance targets such as uptime?","question_es":"¿Qué característica de Azure define objetivos de rendimiento como tiempo de actividad?","options":{"A":"Azure Monitor Logs","B":"Azure Policy","C":"Azure Service Level Agreements (SLAs)","D":"Azure Security Center"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Monitor Logs","B":"Azure Policy","C":"Acuerdos de Nivel de Servicio (SLA)","D":"Microsoft Defender for Cloud"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Los SLA definen metas oficiales de disponibilidad y rendimiento para los servicios de Azure."},{"id":60,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match each cloud service category to the correct example.","question_es":"Relaciona cada categoría de servicio en la nube con el ejemplo correcto.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Azure Files","description_es":"Azure Files","correct":"Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS)"},{"description_en":"Dynamics 365","description_es":"Dynamics 365","correct":"Software as a Service (SaaS)"},{"description_en":"A cloud-based accounting system","description_es":"Un sistema contable basado en la nube","correct":"Platform as a Service (PaaS)"}],"explanation":"Azure Files es IaaS. Dynamics 365 es SaaS. Un sistema contable basado en la nube se ejecuta como una aplicación PaaS."},{"id":61,"type":"multi","question_en":"You need to deploy and manage containerized applications in Azure. Which two services are most suitable?","question_es":"Necesitas implementar y administrar aplicaciones contenedorizadas en Azure. ¿Cuáles dos servicios son los más adecuados?","options":{"A":"Azure Virtual Desktop","B":"Azure Virtual Machines","C":"Azure Functions","D":"Azure Container Instances","E":"Azure Kubernetes Service"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Virtual Desktop","B":"Máquinas virtuales de Azure","C":"Azure Functions","D":"Azure Container Instances","E":"Azure Kubernetes Service"},"correct":["D","E"],"explanation":"Azure Container Instances ejecuta contenedores sin servidores. Azure Kubernetes Service administra y orquesta contenedores a escala."},{"id":62,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"To delegate permissions to several Azure virtual machines simultaneously, the virtual machines must be deployed to the same _____.","question_es":"Para delegar permisos a varias máquinas virtuales simultáneamente, las máquinas virtuales deben estar implementadas en el mismo _____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"The virtual machines must be deployed to the same resource group.","statement_es":"Las máquinas virtuales deben estar implementadas en el mismo grupo de recursos.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Azure region","resource group","availability zone","Azure Resource Manager template"],"explanation":"La asignación de permisos RBAC a nivel de resource group permite delegar acceso a múltiples VMs simultáneamente."},{"id":63,"type":"single","question_en":"Evaluate the underlined text: 'One of the benefits of Azure SQL Data Warehouse is that high availability is built into the platform.' Is the statement correct?","question_es":"Evalúa el texto subrayado: 'Uno de los beneficios de Azure SQL Data Warehouse es que la alta disponibilidad está incorporada en la plataforma.' ¿Es correcta la afirmación?","options":{"A":"No change is needed","B":"automatic scaling","C":"data compression","D":"versioning"},"options_es":{"A":"No se necesita ningún cambio","B":"escalado automático","C":"compresión de datos","D":"versionado"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Synapse Analytics incluye capacidades de alta disponibilidad integradas; por lo tanto, la afirmación es correcta."},{"id":64,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"An Azure Container Instance is an example of an Azure ____.","question_es":"Un Azure Container Instance es un ejemplo de un servicio de Azure ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"PaaS","statement_es":"PaaS","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["IaaS","PaaS","SaaS","FaaS"],"explanation":"Azure Container Instances es un servicio PaaS totalmente administrado para ejecutar contenedores sin necesidad de administrar máquinas virtuales."},{"id":65,"type":"single","question_en":"At which layer of the OSI model does Azure ExpressRoute primarily operate?","question_es":"¿En qué capa del modelo OSI opera principalmente Azure ExpressRoute?","options":{"A":"Layer 1 – Physical","B":"Layer 2 – Data Link","C":"Layer 3 – Network","D":"Layer 7 – Application"},"options_es":{"A":"Capa 1 – Física","B":"Capa 2 – Enlace de datos","C":"Capa 3 – Red","D":"Capa 7 – Aplicación"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"ExpressRoute opera sobre conexiones privadas proporcionadas por proveedores a nivel de capa 2, permitiendo luego enrutar tráfico IP en capa 3 hacia los servicios de Microsoft."},{"id":66,"type":"single","question_en":"Application Insights is a feature of _____.","question_es":"Application Insights es una característica de _____.","options":{"A":"Azure Advisor","B":"Azure Application Gateway","C":"Azure Arc","D":"Azure Monitor"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Advisor","B":"Azure Application Gateway","C":"Azure Arc","D":"Azure Monitor"},"correct":["D"],"explanation":"Application Insights es parte de Azure Monitor y está diseñado para monitorear el rendimiento de aplicaciones."},{"id":68,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to automate the creation of identical sets of Azure resources for multiple business units. Would Azure API Management be a suitable solution?","question_es":"Necesitas automatizar la creación de conjuntos idénticos de recursos de Azure para varias unidades de negocio. ¿Sería adecuada la solución Azure API Management?","options":{"A":"Yes, Azure API Management can automate resource deployment.","B":"No, Azure API Management is not designed for automating Azure resources.","C":"Azure API Management can create resource groups for each business unit.","D":"Only PowerShell can be used to automate Azure resource creation."},"options_es":{"A":"Sí, Azure API Management puede automatizar el despliegue de recursos.","B":"No, Azure API Management no está diseñado para automatizar recursos de Azure.","C":"Azure API Management puede crear grupos de recursos para cada unidad de negocio.","D":"Solo PowerShell puede usarse para automatizar la creación de recursos."},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Azure API Management gestiona APIs, no crea infraestructura. Para automatizar recursos se usan ARM Templates, Bicep, Terraform o scripting."},{"id":69,"type":"multi","question_en":"You plan to store 20 TB of data in Azure. The data will be accessed infrequently and visualized using Power BI. Which two Azure solutions should you recommend?","question_es":"Planeas almacenar 20 TB de datos en Azure. Los datos serán accedidos de forma infrecuente y visualizados con Power BI. ¿Cuáles dos soluciones de Azure deberías recomendar?","options":{"A":"Azure Data Lake","B":"Azure Cosmos DB","C":"Azure Synapse Analytics","D":"Azure SQL Database","E":"Azure Database for PostgreSQL"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Data Lake","B":"Azure Cosmos DB","C":"Azure Synapse Analytics","D":"Base de datos SQL de Azure","E":"Azure Database for PostgreSQL"},"correct":["A","C"],"explanation":"Azure Data Lake y Azure Synapse son ideales para grandes volúmenes de datos orientados a análisis y Power BI, con acceso infrecuente."},{"id":70,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"To which URL should you connect to manage all the Azure resources in your environment?","question_es":"¿A qué URL debes conectarte para administrar todos los recursos de Azure en tu entorno?","statements":[{"statement_en":"https://portal.azure.com","statement_es":"https://portal.azure.com","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["admin.azure.com","portal.azure.com","azurewebsites.net","www.microsoft.com"],"explanation":"El portal de Azure se administra desde https://portal.azure.com."},{"id":72,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Arrange the Azure Storage redundancy options from the least redundant to the most redundant.","question_es":"Ordena las opciones de redundancia de Azure Storage desde la menos redundante hasta la más redundante.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Least redundant","description_es":"Menos redundante","correct":"LRS"},{"description_en":"Next level","description_es":"Siguiente nivel","correct":"ZRS"},{"description_en":"More redundant","description_es":"Más redundante","correct":"GRS"},{"description_en":"Most redundant","description_es":"Más redundante","correct":"GZRS"}],"explanation":"LRS < ZRS < GRS < GZRS, de menor a mayor redundancia."},{"id":73,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Azure Blob Storage is a _____.","question_es":"Azure Blob Storage es un _____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"storage service optimized for very large objects such as videos and images","statement_es":"servicio de almacenamiento optimizado para objetos muy grandes, como videos e imágenes","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["service for queuing and reliably delivering messages","file share that can be mapped as a network drive","key/value store for non-relational structured data","storage service optimized for very large objects such as videos and images"],"explanation":"Blob Storage es almacenamiento de objetos grandes (videos, imágenes, backups)."},{"id":74,"type":"single","question_en":"An administrator plans to run a PowerShell script to create Azure resources. The solution is to run the script from a Chrome OS computer using Azure Cloud Shell. Does this meet the goal?","question_es":"Un administrador planea ejecutar un script de PowerShell para crear recursos de Azure. La solución es ejecutar el script desde un equipo con Chrome OS usando Azure Cloud Shell. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Cloud Shell se ejecuta desde el navegador y soporta PowerShell, incluso en dispositivos Chrome OS."},{"id":75,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise select No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones, selecciona Sí si es verdadera. De lo contrario selecciona No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"From Azure Service Health, an administrator can create a rule to be alerted about service issues.","statement_es":"Desde Azure Service Health, un administrador puede crear una regla para recibir alertas sobre problemas de servicio.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"From Azure Service Health, an administrator can view the health of all Azure services.","statement_es":"Desde Azure Service Health, un administrador puede ver el estado de todos los servicios de Azure.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"From Azure Resource Health, an administrator can prevent a service failure affecting a virtual machine.","statement_es":"Desde Azure Resource Health, un administrador puede prevenir una falla que afecte a una máquina virtual.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"Service Health puede generar alertas y mostrar estados de servicios, mientras que Resource Health solo muestra salud individual del recurso y no previene fallas."},{"id":76,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You need to view a list of planned maintenance events that can affect the availability of an Azure subscription. Which blade should you use in the Azure portal?","question_es":"Necesitas ver una lista de eventos de mantenimiento planificado que pueden afectar la disponibilidad de una suscripción de Azure. ¿Qué blade debes usar en el portal de Azure?","statements":[{"statement_en":"Service Health","statement_es":"Service Health","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Dashboard","All Resources","Resource Groups","Help + Support","Service Health","Advisor"],"explanation":"El blade de Service Health muestra eventos de mantenimiento planificado, incidentes y notificaciones relevantes para tus recursos de Azure."},{"id":77,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You need to view planned maintenance events that can affect the availability of Azure services. Which blade should you use in the Azure portal?","question_es":"Necesitas ver eventos de mantenimiento planificado que pueden afectar la disponibilidad de los servicios de Azure. ¿Qué blade debes usar en el portal de Azure?","statements":[{"statement_en":"Service Health","statement_es":"Service Health","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Dashboard","All Resources","Resource Groups","Help + Support","Service Health","Advisor"],"explanation":"El blade de Service Health muestra el estado de servicios, incidentes y el apartado de mantenimiento planificado, que es lo solicitado en esta pregunta."},{"id":78,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the Azure service to the correct definition.","question_es":"Relaciona el servicio de Azure con su definición correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"An integrated solution for the deployment of code","description_es":"Una solución integrada para la implementación de código","correct":"Azure DevOps"},{"description_en":"A solution that provides guidance and recommendations to improve an Azure environment","description_es":"Un servicio que ofrece orientación y recomendaciones para mejorar un entorno de Azure","correct":"Azure Advisor"},{"description_en":"A simplified tool to build intelligent AI applications","description_es":"Una herramienta simplificada para crear aplicaciones inteligentes de IA","correct":"Azure Cognitive Services"},{"description_en":"Monitors web applications","description_es":"Supervisa aplicaciones web","correct":"Azure Application Insights"}],"explanation":"Azure DevOps gestiona CI/CD, Advisor da recomendaciones, Cognitive Services provee APIs de IA, y App Insights monitorea aplicaciones."},{"id":79,"type":"single","question_en":"You propose incorporating management groups into the automation strategy for creating identical Azure resources across business units. Does this solution meet the goal?","question_es":"Propones usar management groups para automatizar la creación de recursos idénticos en varias unidades de negocio. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Los management groups no despliegan recursos, solo organizan suscripciones y aplican gobernanza. Para automatizar creación se requieren plantillas o herramientas de despliegue."},{"id":81,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Identify which Azure portal blade is used for each task.","question_es":"Identifica qué blade del portal de Azure se utiliza para cada tarea.","statements":[{"statement_en":"View security recommendations","statement_es":"Ver recomendaciones de seguridad","correct":"Advisor"},{"statement_en":"Monitor the health of Azure services","statement_es":"Monitorizar la salud de los servicios de Azure","correct":"Monitor"},{"statement_en":"Browse available virtual machine images","statement_es":"Examinar imágenes disponibles de máquinas virtuales","correct":"Marketplace"}],"options":["Monitor","Subscriptions","Marketplace","Advisor"],"explanation":"Advisor muestra recomendaciones; Monitor muestra la salud del sistema; Marketplace permite examinar imágenes de VM disponibles."},{"id":82,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Select the correct Azure portal blade for each requirement.","question_es":"Selecciona el blade correcto del portal de Azure para cada requisito.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Monitor the health of Azure services","statement_es":"Monitorizar la salud de los servicios de Azure","correct":"Monitor"},{"statement_en":"Browse available virtual machine images","statement_es":"Examinar imágenes disponibles de máquinas virtuales","correct":"Marketplace"},{"statement_en":"View security recommendations","statement_es":"Ver recomendaciones de seguridad","correct":"Advisor"}],"options":["Monitor","Subscriptions","Marketplace","Advisor"],"explanation":"Monitor muestra la salud del sistema; Marketplace lista imágenes de VM; Advisor ofrece recomendaciones de seguridad."},{"id":83,"type":"single","question_en":"Which serverless computing solution should you recommend for an application that sends email notifications based on rules?","question_es":"¿Qué solución serverless deberías recomendar para una aplicación que envía notificaciones por correo basadas en reglas?","options":{"A":"A web app","B":"A server image in Azure Marketplace","C":"A logic app","D":"An API app"},"options_es":{"A":"Una aplicación web","B":"Una imagen de servidor desde Azure Marketplace","C":"Una Logic App","D":"Una API App"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Logic Apps proporciona automatización basada en flujos y reglas sin necesidad de administrar servidores, ideal para enviar correos electrónicos automáticos."},{"id":84,"type":"single","question_en":"You plan to host a website with large video files for a global audience. Which Azure service should you use to ensure optimal playback?","question_es":"Planeas alojar un sitio web con archivos de video grandes para una audiencia global. ¿Qué servicio de Azure debes usar para garantizar una reproducción óptima?","options":{"A":"Azure Application Gateway","B":"Azure ExpressRoute","C":"Azure Content Delivery Network (CDN)","D":"Azure Traffic Manager"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Application Gateway","B":"Azure ExpressRoute","C":"Azure Content Delivery Network (CDN)","D":"Azure Traffic Manager"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure CDN cachea contenido en ubicaciones globales, reduciendo la latencia y mejorando la reproducción de videos."},{"id":85,"type":"multi","question_en":"Your company plans to deploy several million sensors that will upload data to Azure. Which two Azure resources should you identify?","question_es":"Tu empresa planea implementar varios millones de sensores que cargarán datos a Azure. ¿Qué dos recursos de Azure debes identificar?","options":{"A":"Azure Data Lake","B":"Azure Queue Storage","C":"Azure File Storage","D":"Azure IoT Hub","E":"Azure Notification Hubs"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Data Lake","B":"Azure Queue Storage","C":"Azure File Storage","D":"Azure IoT Hub","E":"Azure Notification Hubs"},"correct":["A","D"],"explanation":"IoT Hub maneja millones de dispositivos IoT y Data Lake almacena volúmenes enormes de datos. Las otras opciones no son adecuadas para ingestión masiva de sensores."},{"id":88,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service can automatically send an alert when an administrator stops an Azure virtual machine?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure puede enviar automáticamente una alerta cuando un administrador detiene una máquina virtual?","options":{"A":"Azure Advisor","B":"Azure Service Health","C":"Azure Monitor","D":"Azure Network Watcher"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Advisor","B":"Azure Service Health","C":"Azure Monitor","D":"Azure Network Watcher"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure Monitor puede generar alertas basadas en logs y eventos administrativos, incluyendo cuando una VM se detiene."},{"id":89,"type":"single","question_en":"Your company has multiple business units that require identical sets of Azure resources. Which strategy should you recommend to automate creation of these resources?","question_es":"Tu empresa tiene varias unidades de negocio que requieren conjuntos idénticos de recursos en Azure. ¿Qué estrategia deberías recomendar para automatizar su creación?","options":{"A":"Implement Azure Resource Manager (ARM) templates","B":"Manually create resources through the portal","C":"Use PowerShell scripts"},"options_es":{"A":"Implementar plantillas ARM","B":"Crear los recursos manualmente en el portal","C":"Usar scripts de PowerShell"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"ARM templates son la solución estándar para despliegues automatizados, reproducibles y versionables en Azure."},{"id":90,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the Azure service to the correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona cada servicio de Azure con la descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Provides a cloud-based Enterprise Data Warehouse (EDW)","description_es":"Proporciona un almacén de datos empresarial (EDW) basado en la nube","correct":"Azure SQL Synapse Analytics"},{"description_en":"Uses past trainings to provide predictions that have high probability","description_es":"Usa entrenamientos previos para proporcionar predicciones de alta probabilidad","correct":"Azure Machine Learning"},{"description_en":"Provides serverless computing functionalities","description_es":"Proporciona funcionalidades de cómputo sin servidor","correct":"Azure Functions"},{"description_en":"Processes data from millions of sensors","description_es":"Procesa datos provenientes de millones de sensores","correct":"Azure IoT Hub"}],"explanation":"Synapse es el EDW en la nube; Machine Learning genera predicciones; Functions ejecuta código sin servidores; IoT Hub conecta millones de dispositivos IoT."},{"id":91,"type":"multi","question_en":"You need to create a new Azure virtual machine from a tablet running Android. Which three options are valid solutions?","question_es":"Necesitas crear una nueva máquina virtual de Azure desde una tablet Android. ¿Cuáles tres opciones son soluciones válidas?","options":{"A":"Use Bash in Azure Cloud Shell","B":"Use PowerShell in Azure Cloud Shell","C":"Use the Azure Portal","D":"Use Windows PowerShell installed locally","E":"Use Azure CLI installed locally"},"options_es":{"A":"Usar Bash en Azure Cloud Shell","B":"Usar PowerShell en Azure Cloud Shell","C":"Usar el Portal de Azure","D":"Usar Windows PowerShell instalado localmente","E":"Usar Azure CLI instalada localmente"},"correct":["A","B","C"],"explanation":"Azure Cloud Shell (Bash o PowerShell) y el portal pueden usarse desde un dispositivo Android. No es posible instalar PowerShell o Azure CLI localmente en Android."},{"id":92,"type":"single","question_en":"A development team plans to deploy and remove 50 virtual machines weekly for testing. All VMs use ARM templates. Which Azure service minimizes administrative effort?","question_es":"Un equipo de desarrollo planea implementar y eliminar 50 máquinas virtuales semanalmente para pruebas. Todas las VMs usan plantillas ARM. ¿Qué servicio minimiza el esfuerzo administrativo?","options":{"A":"Azure Reserved VM Instances","B":"Azure DevTest Labs","C":"Azure Virtual Machine Scale Sets","D":"Azure Virtual Desktop"},"options_es":{"A":"Instancias reservadas de Azure","B":"Azure DevTest Labs","C":"Conjuntos de máquinas virtuales (Scale Sets)","D":"Azure Virtual Desktop"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Azure DevTest Labs está diseñado para crear y eliminar entornos de prueba rápidamente, integrándose con ARM templates y automatizando su ciclo de vida."},{"id":94,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to create VM1 using the Azure CLI command. Solution: Launch Azure Cloud Shell in PowerShell mode and run the command. Does this meet the goal?","question_es":"Necesitas crear la VM1 usando el comando Azure CLI. Solución: Iniciar Azure Cloud Shell en modo PowerShell y ejecutar el comando. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Cloud Shell incluye Azure CLI tanto en Bash como en PowerShell, por lo que ejecutar 'az vm create' desde PowerShell es totalmente válido."},{"id":95,"type":"single","question_en":"Solution: Install the Azure CLI on a Windows 10 computer, sign in from PowerShell, and run the Azure CLI command. Does this meet the goal?","question_es":"Solución: Instalar Azure CLI en una computadora con Windows 10, iniciar sesión desde PowerShell y ejecutar el comando Azure CLI. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Instalar Azure CLI en Windows 10 permite ejecutar comandos 'az' desde PowerShell, cumpliendo con el objetivo planteado."},{"id":96,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Identify which Azure management tools can be used from each computer.","question_es":"Identifica qué herramientas de administración de Azure se pueden usar desde cada computadora.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Computer 1 (Windows 10)","statement_es":"Computadora 1 (Windows 10)","correct":"Azure CLI, Azure Portal, Azure PowerShell"},{"statement_en":"Computer 2 (Ubuntu)","statement_es":"Computadora 2 (Ubuntu)","correct":"Azure CLI, Azure Portal"},{"statement_en":"Computer 3 (macOS Mojave)","statement_es":"Computadora 3 (macOS Mojave)","correct":"Azure CLI, Azure Portal"}],"options":["Azure CLI and Azure Portal","Azure Portal and Azure PowerShell","Azure CLI and Azure PowerShell","Azure CLI, Azure Portal, and Azure PowerShell"],"explanation":"El portal funciona en cualquier OS. Azure CLI funciona en Windows, Linux y macOS. Azure PowerShell funciona en Windows y también en Linux/macOS, pero esta pregunta toma la versión del examen donde la opción marcada como correcta excluye PowerShell en Linux/macOS."},{"id":97,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You can access Compliance Manager from the _____.","question_es":"Puedes acceder a Compliance Manager desde el _____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Microsoft Service Trust Portal","statement_es":"Microsoft Service Trust Portal","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Azure Active Directory admin center","Azure portal","Microsoft 365 admin center","Microsoft Service Trust Portal"],"explanation":"Compliance Manager es parte del Microsoft Service Trust Portal, el sitio centralizado para auditorías, cumplimiento y certificaciones."},{"id":98,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Azure Resource Manager templates provide a common platform for deploying objects to a cloud infrastructure and for implementing consistency across the Azure environment.","question_es":"Las plantillas de Azure Resource Manager proporcionan una plataforma común para implementar objetos en una infraestructura de nube y para implementar consistencia en todo el entorno de Azure.","statements":[{"statement_en":"ARM templates provide a common platform for deploying objects to the cloud.","statement_es":"Las plantillas ARM proporcionan una plataforma común para la implementación de objetos en la nube.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Azure Resource Manager templates","Azure Policies","Resource Groups","Management Groups"],"explanation":"Solo ARM Templates son la plataforma estándar para despliegues y consistencia de recursos en Azure."},{"id":99,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to guarantee 99.99% availability for an application hosted on virtual machines. Solution: Deploy two virtual machines in a single Availability Zone. Does this meet the goal?","question_es":"Necesitas garantizar un 99.99% de disponibilidad para una aplicación alojada en máquinas virtuales. Solución: Implementar dos máquinas virtuales en una sola Availability Zone. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Una sola Availability Zone no proporciona suficiente redundancia para lograr el SLA de 99.99%. Se requieren al menos dos zonas."},{"id":101,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the Azure services to the correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona los servicios de Azure con su descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Provide operating system virtualization","description_es":"Proporcionan virtualización del sistema operativo","correct":"Azure Virtual Machines"},{"description_en":"Provide a portable containerized environment","description_es":"Proporcionan un entorno portátil en contenedores","correct":"Azure Container Instances"},{"description_en":"Used to build, deploy, and scale web apps","description_es":"Se utiliza para crear, implementar y escalar aplicaciones web","correct":"Azure App Service"},{"description_en":"Provide a platform for serverless code","description_es":"Proporcionan una plataforma para código sin servidor","correct":"Azure Functions"}],"explanation":"Cada servicio corresponde a un modelo distinto: VMs ofrecen SO completo, ACI ejecuta contenedores, App Service es PaaS para web apps y Functions ejecuta código serverless."},{"id":102,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service provides a serverless computing environment, allowing you to run code without managing servers?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure proporciona un entorno de computación sin servidor, permitiéndote ejecutar código sin administrar servidores?","options":{"A":"Azure Virtual Machines","B":"Azure Container Instances","C":"Azure Functions","D":"Azure App Service"},"options_es":{"A":"Máquinas virtuales de Azure","B":"Azure Container Instances","C":"Azure Functions","D":"Azure App Service"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure Functions permite ejecutar código serverless activado por eventos sin gestionar infraestructura."},{"id":103,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service is serverless and allows you to run code without managing servers?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure es serverless y permite ejecutar código sin administrar servidores?","options":{"A":"Azure Virtual Machines","B":"Azure Functions","C":"Azure Storage Account","D":"Azure Dedicated Hosts"},"options_es":{"A":"Máquinas virtuales de Azure","B":"Azure Functions","C":"Cuenta de almacenamiento de Azure","D":"Azure Dedicated Hosts"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Azure Functions es un servicio serverless que ejecuta código bajo demanda sin necesidad de administrar infraestructura."},{"id":104,"type":"multi","question_en":"Which three computers can run an Azure PowerShell script?","question_es":"¿Qué tres computadoras pueden ejecutar un script de Azure PowerShell?","options":{"A":"macOS with PowerShell Core 6.0","B":"Windows 10 with Azure PowerShell module","C":"Linux with Azure PowerShell module","D":"Linux with Azure CLI","E":"Chrome OS using Azure Cloud Shell"},"options_es":{"A":"macOS con PowerShell Core 6.0","B":"Windows 10 con módulo Azure PowerShell","C":"Linux con módulo Azure PowerShell","D":"Linux con Azure CLI","E":"Chrome OS utilizando Azure Cloud Shell"},"correct":["B","C","E"],"explanation":"Para ejecutar scripts PowerShell se necesita PowerShell + módulo Az. Windows, Linux y Cloud Shell cumplen con esto."},{"id":105,"type":"single","question_en":"You launch Azure Cloud Shell in Bash mode and run the Azure CLI command to create a VM. Does this meet the goal?","question_es":"Abres Azure Cloud Shell en modo Bash y ejecutas el comando Azure CLI para crear una VM. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Cloud Shell en modo Bash incluye Azure CLI, por lo que ejecutar 'az vm create' funciona correctamente."},{"id":106,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to automate the creation of identical Azure resources for multiple business units. What should you include in your recommendation?","question_es":"Necesitas automatizar la creación de recursos idénticos de Azure para varias unidades de negocio. ¿Qué debes recomendar?","options":{"A":"Azure Resource Manager templates","B":"Virtual machine scale sets","C":"Azure API Management","D":"Management groups"},"options_es":{"A":"Plantillas de Azure Resource Manager","B":"Conjuntos de máquinas virtuales (Scale Sets)","C":"Azure API Management","D":"Management Groups"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Las plantillas ARM permiten automatizar despliegues repetibles y consistentes de conjuntos de recursos, ideales para múltiples unidades."},{"id":107,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if true, otherwise select No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario selecciona No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"You can use Azure Cost Management to view costs associated to management groups.","statement_es":"Puedes usar Azure Cost Management para ver costos asociados a management groups.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"You can use Azure Cost Management to view costs associated to resource groups.","statement_es":"Puedes usar Azure Cost Management para ver costos asociados a resource groups.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"You can use Azure Cost Management to view the usage of virtual machines during the last three months.","statement_es":"Puedes usar Azure Cost Management para ver el uso de las máquinas virtuales durante los últimos tres meses.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"Cost Management analiza costos por subscription, management group o resource group, pero no muestra métricas de uso de VM."},{"id":108,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service helps identify underutilized or unused virtual machines to optimize cloud spending?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure ayuda a identificar máquinas virtuales infrautilizadas o no utilizadas para optimizar el gasto en la nube?","options":{"A":"Azure Advisor","B":"Azure Monitor","C":"Azure Service Health","D":"Azure Policy"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Advisor","B":"Azure Monitor","C":"Azure Service Health","D":"Azure Policy"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Advisor identifica VMs infrautilizadas y recomienda acciones para reducir costos."},{"id":109,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Which node in the Azure portal should you use to assign a user the Reader role for a resource group?","question_es":"¿Qué nodo del portal de Azure debes usar para asignar a un usuario el rol Reader en un grupo de recursos?","statements":[{"statement_en":"Access control (IAM)","statement_es":"Access control (IAM)","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Activity log","Access control (IAM)","Tags","Resource visualizer","Events","Resource costs","Deployments","Security","Policies","Properties"],"explanation":"La asignación de roles RBAC se realiza desde el nodo Access control (IAM), no desde Overview ni desde otros paneles."},{"id":110,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure storage redundancy option should you recommend to store data across multiple nodes in separate geographic locations while allowing read access from the secondary region?","question_es":"¿Qué opción de redundancia de almacenamiento de Azure deberías recomendar para almacenar datos en múltiples nodos en ubicaciones geográficas separadas permitiendo lectura desde la región secundaria?","options":{"A":"Geo-redundant storage (GRS)","B":"Read-access geo-redundant storage (RA-GRS)","C":"Zone-redundant storage (ZRS)","D":"Locally redundant storage (LRS)"},"options_es":{"A":"Almacenamiento georredundante (GRS)","B":"Almacenamiento georredundante con acceso de lectura (RA-GRS)","C":"Almacenamiento redundante entre zonas (ZRS)","D":"Almacenamiento localmente redundante (LRS)"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Solo RA-GRS replica datos en regiones distintas y permite lectura desde la región secundaria; por eso es la única opción que cumple todos los requisitos."},{"id":111,"type":"single","question_en":"What is the initial Azure resource you should create to begin exploring Azure capabilities?","question_es":"¿Cuál es el primer recurso de Azure que debes crear para comenzar a explorar sus capacidades?","options":{"A":"A subscription","B":"A resource group","C":"A virtual network","D":"A management group"},"options_es":{"A":"Una suscripción","B":"Un grupo de recursos","C":"Una red virtual","D":"Un management group"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"La suscripción es el contenedor fundamental de Azure. Todos los demás recursos dependen de ella."},{"id":112,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about resource groups, select Yes if true; otherwise select No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre los grupos de recursos, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario selecciona No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"All resources in a resource group must use the same Azure region.","statement_es":"Todos los recursos en un grupo de recursos deben usar la misma región de Azure.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"If you assign a tag to a resource group, all resources in that group inherit the tag.","statement_es":"Si asignas un tag a un grupo de recursos, todos los recursos en ese grupo heredan el tag.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"If you assign permissions to a user to manage a resource group, they can manage all resources within that group.","statement_es":"Si asignas permisos a un usuario para administrar un grupo de recursos, puede administrar todos los recursos dentro de ese grupo.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"Los recursos pueden estar en distintas regiones; los tags no se heredan; los permisos RBAC sí aplican a todos los recursos del grupo."},{"id":113,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Complete the sentence: Data stored in the Archive access tier of an Azure Storage account ____.","question_es":"Completa la frase: Los datos almacenados en el tier Archive de una cuenta de Azure Storage ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"must be rehydrated before the data can be accessed","statement_es":"deben ser rehidratados antes de que los datos puedan ser accedidos","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["can be accessed using azcopy anytime","can only be read by Azure Backup","must be restored before the data can be accessed","must be rehydrated before the data can be accessed"],"explanation":"El tier Archive es offline; los blobs deben rehidratarse a Hot o Cool para poder accederse."},{"id":114,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to deploy a virtual machine to a subscription. What should you do first?","question_es":"Necesitas desplegar una máquina virtual a una suscripción. ¿Qué debes hacer primero?","options":{"A":"Create a resource group","B":"Create a virtual network","C":"Create a virtual machine","D":"Create a virtual machine scale set"},"options_es":{"A":"Crear un grupo de recursos","B":"Crear una red virtual","C":"Crear una máquina virtual","D":"Crear un conjunto de máquinas virtuales (Scale Set)"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"El grupo de recursos es el contenedor fundamental de Azure. Todos los demás recursos dependen de él."},{"id":115,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You need to deploy an application with a guaranteed availability of 99.99%. Select the minimum number of virtual machines and availability zones required.","question_es":"Necesitas implementar una aplicación con una disponibilidad garantizada de 99.99%. Selecciona el número mínimo de máquinas virtuales y zonas de disponibilidad requeridas.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Minimum number of virtual machines: 2","statement_es":"Número mínimo de máquinas virtuales: 2","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Minimum number of availability zones: 2","statement_es":"Número mínimo de zonas de disponibilidad: 2","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["1 VM","2 VMs","1 AZ","2 AZs"],"explanation":"Para alcanzar 99.99% SLA, es necesario distribuir dos máquinas virtuales entre dos Availability Zones."},{"id":116,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match each Azure service to its correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona cada servicio de Azure con su descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Provides the platform for serverless code","description_es":"Proporciona la plataforma para código sin servidor","correct":"Azure Functions"},{"description_en":"A big data analysis service for machine learning","description_es":"Un servicio de análisis big data para machine learning","correct":"Azure Databricks"},{"description_en":"Detects and diagnoses anomalies in web apps","description_es":"Detecta y diagnostica anomalías en aplicaciones web","correct":"Azure Application Insights"},{"description_en":"Hosts web apps","description_es":"Hospeda aplicaciones web","correct":"Azure App Service"}],"explanation":"Functions es serverless, Databricks es análisis Big Data basado en Spark, Application Insights monitorea y detecta anomalías, y App Service hospeda aplicaciones web."},{"id":117,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement, select Yes if true; otherwise select No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario, No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Azure PowerShell modules can be installed on macOS.","statement_es":"Los módulos de Azure PowerShell pueden instalarse en macOS.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Azure Cloud Shell can be accessed from a web browser on a Linux computer.","statement_es":"Azure Cloud Shell puede accederse desde un navegador en un equipo Linux.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"The Azure portal can only be accessed from a Windows device.","statement_es":"El portal de Azure solo puede accederse desde un dispositivo Windows.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"PowerShell y Cloud Shell funcionan en macOS, Linux y Windows; el portal de Azure se accede desde cualquier navegador moderno."},{"id":118,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each of the following statements about managing Azure cloud services, select Yes if the statement is true; otherwise No.","question_es":"Para cada una de las siguientes afirmaciones sobre la administración de servicios en la nube de Azure, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"You must have internet connectivity to manage cloud services.","statement_es":"Debes tener conectividad a Internet para administrar servicios en la nube.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"You must install a management app to manage cloud services.","statement_es":"Debes instalar una aplicación de administración para gestionar servicios en la nube.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"You can manage cloud services from any modern web browser.","statement_es":"Puedes administrar servicios en la nube desde cualquier navegador moderno.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Yes","No"],"explanation":"Azure se administra desde portal.azure.com, por lo que se requiere Internet. No hace falta ninguna app instalada; cualquier navegador moderno funciona."},{"id":119,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the Azure service to the correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona el servicio de Azure con la descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Provides the platform for serverless code","description_es":"Proporciona la plataforma para código serverless","correct":"Azure Functions"},{"description_en":"Big data analytics service for machine learning","description_es":"Servicio de análisis Big Data para machine learning","correct":"Azure Databricks"},{"description_en":"Detects and diagnoses anomalies in web apps","description_es":"Detecta y diagnostica anomalías en aplicaciones web","correct":"Azure Application Insights"},{"description_en":"Hosts web apps","description_es":"Hospeda aplicaciones web","correct":"Azure App Service"}],"explanation":"Functions es serverless; Databricks permite análisis en Apache Spark; Application Insights detecta anomalías y App Service hospeda aplicaciones web."},{"id":120,"type":"multi","question_en":"Which two tools can be used to run the Azure CLI on a Windows computer?","question_es":"¿Qué dos herramientas pueden usarse para ejecutar Azure CLI en un equipo con Windows?","options":{"A":"Command Prompt","B":"Azure Resource Explorer","C":"Windows PowerShell","D":"Windows Defender Firewall","E":"Network and Sharing Center"},"options_es":{"A":"Command Prompt","B":"Azure Resource Explorer","C":"Windows PowerShell","D":"Firewall de Windows Defender","E":"Centro de redes y recursos compartidos"},"correct":["A","C"],"explanation":"Azure CLI puede ejecutarse desde Command Prompt o Windows PowerShell. Las otras herramientas no están diseñadas para ejecutar CLI."},{"id":121,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Complete the sentence: ______ provides in-depth information about security, privacy, compliance offerings, policies, and features across Microsoft cloud products.","question_es":"Completa la frase: ______ proporciona información profunda sobre seguridad, privacidad, ofertas de cumplimiento, políticas y características en los productos cloud de Microsoft.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Microsoft Trust Center","statement_es":"Microsoft Trust Center","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Microsoft 365 Compliance admin center","Microsoft 365 Defender portal","Microsoft Defender for Cloud","Microsoft Trust Center"],"explanation":"Microsoft Trust Center es el portal oficial sobre seguridad, privacidad y cumplimiento para todos los productos cloud de Microsoft."},{"id":122,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Which Azure support plans allow opening new support requests? Drag the correct options.","question_es":"¿Qué planes de soporte de Azure permiten abrir solicitudes de soporte? Arrastra las opciones correctas.","options":["Basic","Developer","Standard","Professional Direct","Premier"],"correct":["Developer","Standard","Professional Direct","Premier"],"explanation":"El plan Basic no permite abrir casos técnicos. Developer, Standard, Professional Direct y Premier sí lo permiten."},{"id":123,"type":"single","question_en":"Which expenditure model should you recommend for a pay-as-you-go Azure subscription?","question_es":"¿Qué modelo de gastos debes recomendar para una suscripción de Azure de pago por uso?","options":{"A":"Capital Expenditure (CapEx)","B":"Operational Expenditure (OpEx)","C":"Elastic Expenditure Model","D":"Reserved Instance Model"},"options_es":{"A":"Gastos de capital (CapEx)","B":"Gastos operativos (OpEx)","C":"Modelo de gasto elástico","D":"Modelo de instancias reservadas"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Pay-as-you-go es un modelo operativo basado en consumo, por lo que corresponde a OpEx."},{"id":125,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"An Azure subscription can be associated to multiple Azure AD tenants.","statement_es":"Una suscripción de Azure puede asociarse a múltiples tenants de Azure AD.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"You can change the Azure AD tenant to which a subscription is associated.","statement_es":"Puedes cambiar el tenant de Azure AD al que está asociada una suscripción.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"When an Azure subscription expires, the associated Azure AD tenant is deleted automatically.","statement_es":"Cuando una suscripción de Azure expira, el tenant asociado se elimina automáticamente.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"Las suscripciones solo pertenecen a un tenant. Sí pueden moverse. La expiración no borra el tenant."},{"id":126,"type":"single","question_en":"Resource groups provide the ability to manage compliance across multiple subscriptions.","question_es":"Los grupos de recursos permiten administrar el cumplimiento a través de múltiples suscripciones.","options":{"A":"No change is needed","B":"Management groups","C":"Azure policies","D":"Azure App Service plans"},"options_es":{"A":"No se necesita ningún cambio","B":"Management Groups","C":"Azure Policies","D":"Planes de App Service"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"El cumplimiento se administra con Azure Policy, no con grupos de recursos."},{"id":127,"type":"multi","question_en":"Which two techniques can be used to segment Azure resources for different departments?","question_es":"¿Qué dos técnicas pueden usarse para segmentar recursos de Azure para distintos departamentos?","options":{"A":"Multiple subscriptions","B":"Multiple Azure Active Directory (Azure AD) directories","C":"Multiple regions"},"options_es":{"A":"Múltiples suscripciones","B":"Múltiples directorios de Azure AD","C":"Múltiples regiones"},"correct":["A","B"],"explanation":"Las suscripciones segmentan recursos; múltiples tenants segmentan identidades. Las regiones no segmentan permisos ni administración."},{"id":129,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service is used to manage access to Azure resources?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure se usa para gestionar el acceso a los recursos de Azure?","options":{"A":"Azure Active Directory","B":"Azure Monitor","C":"Azure Key Vault","D":"Azure Policy"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Active Directory","B":"Azure Monitor","C":"Azure Key Vault","D":"Azure Policy"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Active Directory es el servicio de gestión de identidades y acceso en Azure."},{"id":130,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Your Azure subscription contains several virtual machines. You create a new subscription. Complete the sentence.","question_es":"Tu suscripción de Azure contiene varias máquinas virtuales. Creas una nueva suscripción. Completa la frase.","statements":[{"statement_en":"The virtual machines can be moved to the new subscription.","statement_es":"Las máquinas virtuales pueden moverse a la nueva suscripción.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["The virtual machines cannot be moved to the new subscription.","The virtual machines can be moved to the new subscription.","The virtual machines can be moved only if they are in the same resource group.","The virtual machines can be moved only if they run Windows Server 2016."],"explanation":"Azure permite mover VMs entre suscripciones sin importar el sistema operativo."},{"id":131,"type":"multi","question_en":"Which two Azure resources should you include to allow on-premises clients to communicate with Azure VMs?","question_es":"¿Qué dos recursos de Azure debes incluir para permitir que clientes on-premises se comuniquen con máquinas virtuales de Azure?","options":{"A":"Virtual network gateway","B":"Load balancer","C":"Application gateway","D":"Virtual network","E":"Gateway subnet"},"options_es":{"A":"Gateway de red virtual","B":"Balanceador de carga","C":"Application Gateway","D":"Red virtual","E":"Subred de gateway"},"correct":["A","D","E"],"explanation":"Una VPN S2S requiere una VNET, una gateway subnet y un Virtual Network Gateway."},{"id":132,"type":"single","question_en":"You receive a message indicating you must increase your Azure subscription limits. What should you do?","question_es":"Recibes un mensaje indicando que debes aumentar los límites de tu suscripción de Azure. ¿Qué debes hacer?","options":{"A":"Create a service health alert","B":"Upgrade your support plan","C":"Modify an Azure policy","D":"Create a new support request"},"options_es":{"A":"Crear una alerta de estado del servicio","B":"Actualizar el plan de soporte","C":"Modificar una Azure Policy","D":"Crear una nueva solicitud de soporte"},"correct":["D"],"explanation":"Los aumentos de cuota siempre se solicitan mediante un ticket de soporte a Microsoft."},{"id":134,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Availability Zones, select Yes if true, otherwise No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre Availability Zones, selecciona Sí si es verdadera; de lo contrario, No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Availability zones can be implemented in all Azure regions.","statement_es":"Las Availability Zones pueden implementarse en todas las regiones de Azure.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Only virtual machines that run Windows Server can be created in availability zones.","statement_es":"Solo las máquinas virtuales que ejecutan Windows Server pueden crearse en Availability Zones.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Availability zones are used to replicate data and applications to multiple regions.","statement_es":"Las Availability Zones se usan para replicar datos y aplicaciones en múltiples regiones.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"Las Availability Zones solo existen en regiones selectas, permiten VMs Windows y Linux, y proporcionan alta disponibilidad dentro de una misma región."},{"id":135,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Which Azure storage service must be used to store unmanaged virtual machine data disks?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de almacenamiento de Azure debe usarse para almacenar los discos de datos no administrados de una máquina virtual?","statements":[{"statement_en":"Containers","statement_es":"Contenedores","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Containers","File Shares","Queues","Tables"],"explanation":"Los discos no administrados se almacenan como Page Blobs dentro de containers en una cuenta de almacenamiento."},{"id":137,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure solution should you recommend to ensure FinServer resides in a separate network segment?","question_es":"¿Qué solución de Azure deberías recomendar para asegurar que FinServer resida en un segmento de red separado?","options":{"A":"A resource group for FinServer and another for the other servers","B":"A virtual network for FinServer and another for the other servers","C":"A VPN for FinServer and a virtual network gateway for others","D":"One resource group and a resource lock"},"options_es":{"A":"Un resource group para FinServer y otro para el resto","B":"Una red virtual para FinServer y otra para los demás","C":"Una VPN para FinServer y un gateway para los demás","D":"Un resource group y un resource lock"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Solo las redes virtuales segmentan tráfico; los resource groups no afectan la red."},{"id":138,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to create a storage solution in Azure for mapping a network drive from Windows 10 computers. What should you create?","question_es":"Necesitas crear una solución de almacenamiento en Azure para mapear una unidad de red desde computadoras Windows 10. ¿Qué debes crear?","options":{"A":"Azure SQL Database","B":"A virtual machine data disk","C":"A File service in a storage account","D":"A Blob service in a storage account"},"options_es":{"A":"Base de datos SQL de Azure","B":"Disco de datos de máquina virtual","C":"Servicio de archivos en una cuenta de almacenamiento","D":"Servicio de blobs en una cuenta de almacenamiento"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure Files permite montar un recurso SMB para ser mapeado como unidad de red en Windows."},{"id":139,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service is most suitable for collecting events from multiple Azure resources into a centralized repository for real-time analysis?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure es más adecuado para recopilar eventos de múltiples recursos en un repositorio centralizado para análisis en tiempo real?","options":{"A":"Azure Event Hubs","B":"Azure Analysis Services","C":"Azure Monitor","D":"Azure Stream Analytics"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Event Hubs","B":"Azure Analysis Services","C":"Azure Monitor","D":"Azure Stream Analytics"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Event Hubs es el servicio diseñado para ingesta masiva de eventos desde múltiples orígenes."},{"id":140,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Complete the sentence: An Azure Availability Zone has physically separate locations ____.","question_es":"Completa la frase: Una Availability Zone de Azure tiene ubicaciones físicamente separadas ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"within a single Azure region","statement_es":"dentro de una misma región de Azure","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["across a continent","within a single Azure region","within multiple Azure regions","within a single datacenter"],"explanation":"Las Availability Zones son zonas aisladas dentro de la misma región, no entre regiones."},{"id":141,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Azure Storage, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre Azure Storage, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Data stored in an Azure storage account automatically has at least three copies.","statement_es":"Los datos almacenados en una cuenta de almacenamiento de Azure automáticamente tienen al menos tres copias.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Data stored in an Azure storage account is automatically backed up to another Azure datacenter.","statement_es":"Los datos almacenados en una cuenta de almacenamiento de Azure se respaldan automáticamente en otro datacenter.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"An Azure storage account can contain up to 5 PB of data and 1 million files.","statement_es":"Una cuenta de almacenamiento de Azure puede contener hasta 5 PB de datos y un millón de archivos.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"Azure Storage mantiene 3 copias dentro de la región, pero no hace backups automáticos entre datacenters. Los límites reales son mucho más altos que los mencionados."},{"id":142,"type":"single","question_en":"Your company plans to migrate on-premises VMs to a pay-as-you-go Azure subscription. Which expenditure model aligns with this?","question_es":"Tu empresa planea migrar VMs on-premises a una suscripción Azure pay-as-you-go. ¿Qué modelo de gastos corresponde?","options":{"A":"Operational Expenditure (OpEx)","B":"Capital Expenditure (CapEx)","C":"Subscription-based Expenditure","D":"Hybrid Expenditure"},"options_es":{"A":"Gastos operativos (OpEx)","B":"Gastos de capital (CapEx)","C":"Gasto basado en suscripciones","D":"Gasto híbrido"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure pay-as-you-go es un modelo OpEx basado en consumo."},{"id":143,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Azure regions, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre las regiones de Azure, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"North America is represented by a single Azure region.","statement_es":"Norteamérica está representada por una sola región de Azure.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Every Azure region has multiple datacenters.","statement_es":"Cada región de Azure tiene múltiples datacenters.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Data transfers between Azure services in different regions are always free.","statement_es":"Las transferencias de datos entre servicios de Azure en distintas regiones siempre son gratuitas.","correct":"No"}],"explanation":"América del Norte tiene múltiples regiones; cada región tiene varios datacenters; las transferencias entre regiones tienen costo."},{"id":144,"type":"single","question_en":"You deploy virtual machines to two or more scale sets to protect against datacenter failure. Does this meet the goal?","question_es":"Implementas máquinas virtuales en dos o más scale sets para protegerte contra una falla de datacenter. ¿Se cumple el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Los scale sets no garantizan resistencia a la falla de un datacenter. Las Availability Zones sí lo hacen."},{"id":145,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service notifies you about planned maintenance that may affect your resources?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure te notifica sobre mantenimiento planificado que podría afectar tus recursos?","options":{"A":"Azure Monitor","B":"Azure Service Health","C":"Azure Advisor","D":"Microsoft Trust Center"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Monitor","B":"Azure Service Health","C":"Azure Advisor","D":"Microsoft Trust Center"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Service Health envía alertas sobre mantenimiento programado y problemas que afectan tus recursos."},{"id":146,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match each Azure IoT service to the correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona cada servicio IoT de Azure con la descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Provides communication and security features for IoT devices","description_es":"Proporciona comunicación y características de seguridad para dispositivos IoT","correct":"Azure Sphere"},{"description_en":"Provides communication between IoT devices and Azure","description_es":"Proporciona comunicación entre dispositivos IoT y Azure","correct":"Azure IoT Hub"},{"description_en":"A fully managed SaaS solution to connect, monitor, and manage IoT devices at scale","description_es":"Una solución SaaS totalmente administrada para conectar, monitorear y administrar dispositivos IoT a gran escala","correct":"Azure IoT Central"}],"explanation":"Sphere asegura el hardware, IoT Hub maneja comunicación, e IoT Central es SaaS para administración IoT."},{"id":147,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Windows Virtual Desktop, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre Windows Virtual Desktop, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"A WVD session host can run Windows 10 only.","statement_es":"Un host de WVD solo puede ejecutar Windows 10.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"A host pool with 20 session hosts supports a maximum of 20 simultaneous users.","statement_es":"Un host pool con 20 hosts soporta un máximo de 20 usuarios simultáneos.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"WVD supports both desktop and application virtualization.","statement_es":"WVD soporta la virtualización de escritorios y aplicaciones.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"WVD soporta múltiples OS, múltiples sesiones y virtualización completa."},{"id":148,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Complete the sentence: You can calculate cost savings due to reduced electricity consumption after migrating on-premises SQL servers to Azure by using ____.","question_es":"Completa la frase: Puedes calcular el ahorro por reducción de consumo eléctrico al migrar servidores SQL on-premises a Azure utilizando ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"The Azure Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) calculator","statement_es":"La calculadora de Costo Total de Propiedad (TCO) de Azure","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Azure Migrate: Server Assessment","Azure Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) calculator","Database Migration Assistant","Azure Pricing Calculator"],"explanation":"El TCO calculator estima consumo eléctrico, costos on-premises y ahorros al migrar."},{"id":149,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Availability Zones, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre Availability Zones, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Availability Zones protect VMs from a datacenter failure.","statement_es":"Availability Zones protegen VM de una falla de datacenter.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Availability Zones protect VMs from a region failure.","statement_es":"Availability Zones protegen VM de una falla de región.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Availability Zones protect Azure managed disks from a datacenter failure.","statement_es":"Availability Zones protegen discos administrados de una falla de datacenter.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"Las AZ garantizan resiliencia de datacenter, no de región completa."},{"id":150,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"A cloud service that supports a maximum of 20 instances is more scalable than a service that supports a maximum of five instances.","question_es":"Un servicio en la nube que soporta un máximo de 20 instancias es más escalable que un servicio que soporta un máximo de cinco instancias.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Pass","statement_es":"Verdadero","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Pass","Fail"],"explanation":"Un servicio que puede escalar a más instancias es, por definición, más escalable."},{"id":151,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to build, test, and deploy predictive analytics. Which Azure service should you choose?","question_es":"Necesitas crear, probar y desplegar análisis predictivo. ¿Qué servicio de Azure debes usar?","options":{"A":"Azure Cosmos DB","B":"Azure Virtual Machines","C":"Azure Machine Learning","D":"Azure Blob Storage"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Cosmos DB","B":"Máquinas virtuales de Azure","C":"Azure Machine Learning","D":"Azure Blob Storage"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Azure Machine Learning es la plataforma recomendada para modelos predictivos."},{"id":152,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Azure Active Directory, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre Azure Active Directory, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Azure AD credentials can be used to sign in to a Windows 10 computer joined to Azure AD.","statement_es":"Las credenciales de Azure AD pueden usarse para iniciar sesión en un equipo Windows 10 unido a Azure AD.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Users in Azure AD can be organized into groups.","statement_es":"Los usuarios de Azure AD pueden organizarse en grupos.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Azure AD Domain Services supports domain join.","statement_es":"Azure AD Domain Services soporta el domain join.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"Azure AD permite Azure AD Join, soporta grupos y AAD DS provee domain join tradicional."},{"id":153,"type":"multi","question_en":"Which two solutions ensure VM services remain available if a datacenter fails?","question_es":"¿Qué dos soluciones aseguran que las VMs sigan disponibles si falla un datacenter?","options":{"A":"Deploy the VMs to two or more availability zones","B":"Deploy the VMs to multiple resource groups","C":"Deploy the VMs to a scale set","D":"Deploy the VMs to two or more regions"},"options_es":{"A":"Implementar las VMs en dos o más availability zones","B":"Implementar las VMs en múltiples resource groups","C":"Implementar las VMs en un scale set","D":"Implementar las VMs en dos o más regiones"},"correct":["A","D"],"explanation":"Las AZ y las regiones proveen resiliencia ante fallas de datacenter; los resource groups y scale sets no."},{"id":154,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"To ensure VM1 cannot communicate with other VMs, VM1 must ____.","question_es":"Para asegurar que VM1 no pueda comunicarse con otras VMs, VM1 debe ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"be deployed to a separate virtual network","statement_es":"desplegarse en una red virtual separada","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["be deployed to a separate virtual network","run a different operating system","be deployed to a separate resource group","have two network interfaces"],"explanation":"Solo las redes virtuales segmentan tráfico; los resource groups no."},{"id":156,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Azure Key Vault, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre Azure Key Vault, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Azure Key Vault stores secrets and certificates.","statement_es":"Azure Key Vault almacena secretos y certificados.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Azure Key Vault stores keys and certificates.","statement_es":"Azure Key Vault almacena claves y certificados.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Azure Key Vault stores secrets and keys.","statement_es":"Azure Key Vault almacena secretos y claves.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"Key Vault almacena secretos, claves y certificados."},{"id":158,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Azure Storage access tiers, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre los niveles de acceso de Azure Storage, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"The Archive access tier is set at the storage account level.","statement_es":"El nivel de acceso Archive se establece a nivel de cuenta de almacenamiento.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"The Hot access tier is recommended for frequently accessed and modified data.","statement_es":"El nivel Hot se recomienda para datos accedidos y modificados frecuentemente.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"The Cool access tier is recommended for long-term backups.","statement_es":"El nivel Cool se recomienda para copias de seguridad de largo plazo.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"Archive se define por blob; Hot es para datos de acceso frecuente; Cool para almacenamiento a largo plazo."},{"id":159,"type":"single","question_en":"What is the most significant failure scenario that Azure Availability Zones protect against?","question_es":"¿Contra qué escenario de falla protegen principalmente las Azure Availability Zones?","options":{"A":"A physical server failure","B":"An Azure region failure","C":"A storage failure","D":"An Azure datacenter failure"},"options_es":{"A":"Falla de un servidor físico","B":"Falla de una región de Azure","C":"Falla de almacenamiento","D":"Falla de un datacenter de Azure"},"correct":["D"],"explanation":"Las Availability Zones proporcionan tolerancia ante la caída completa de un datacenter dentro de una región."},{"id":160,"type":"single","question_en":"Where can you acquire a third-party virtual security appliance for deployment in Azure?","question_es":"¿Dónde puedes adquirir un appliance virtual de terceros para desplegar en Azure?","options":{"A":"Azure subscriptions","B":"Azure Security Center","C":"Azure Marketplace","D":"Microsoft Store"},"options_es":{"A":"Suscripciones de Azure","B":"Azure Security Center","C":"Azure Marketplace","D":"Microsoft Store"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"El Azure Marketplace es el catálogo oficial de appliances y soluciones de terceros."},{"id":162,"type":"dragdrop","question_en":"Match the Azure governance feature to the correct description.","question_es":"Relaciona la característica de gobernanza de Azure con la descripción correcta.","pairs":[{"description_en":"Identify Azure resources associated with specific cost centers","description_es":"Identificar recursos de Azure asociados a centros de costos específicos","correct":"Tags"},{"description_en":"Deploy a complete Azure application environment including resources, configuration, and role assignments","description_es":"Desplegar un entorno completo de aplicación Azure, incluyendo recursos, configuración y asignación de roles","correct":"Azure Resource Manager templates"}],"explanation":"Tags sirven para clasificación y costos; ARM templates para despliegue consistente de infraestructura."},{"id":163,"type":"single","question_en":"You plan to sync all on-premises Active Directory users to Azure Active Directory to reduce impact after migration. Does this meet the goal?","question_es":"Planeas sincronizar todos los usuarios de Active Directory local con Azure Active Directory para reducir el impacto después de la migración. ¿Cumple esto el objetivo?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Syncing AD to Azure AD permite mantener identidades, credenciales y acceso sin cambios, reduciendo impacto tras la migración."},{"id":165,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"You create a new subscription. Complete the sentence about moving existing virtual machines.","question_es":"Creas una nueva suscripción. Completa la frase sobre mover máquinas virtuales existentes.","statements":[{"statement_en":"The virtual machines can be moved to the new subscription.","statement_es":"Las máquinas virtuales pueden moverse a la nueva suscripción.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["The virtual machines cannot be moved to the new subscription.","The virtual machines can be moved to the new subscription.","The virtual machines can only be moved if they are in the same resource group.","The virtual machines can only be moved if they run Windows Server 2019."],"explanation":"Azure permite mover VMs entre suscripciones independientemente del sistema operativo."},{"id":166,"type":"single","question_en":"Where should you acquire a third-party virtual security appliance for Azure?","question_es":"¿Dónde debes adquirir un appliance virtual de terceros para Azure?","options":{"A":"Azure subscriptions","B":"Microsoft Defender for Cloud","C":"Azure Marketplace","D":"Microsoft Store"},"options_es":{"A":"Suscripciones de Azure","B":"Microsoft Defender for Cloud","C":"Azure Marketplace","D":"Microsoft Store"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"El Azure Marketplace es el catálogo oficial de soluciones de terceros para Azure."},{"id":167,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Complete the sentence about Azure Sphere.","question_es":"Completa la frase sobre Azure Sphere.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Azure Sphere is a highly secure IoT solution that includes a microcontroller unit (MCU) and a customized Linux operating system.","statement_es":"Azure Sphere es una solución IoT altamente segura que incluye un microcontrolador (MCU) y un sistema operativo Linux personalizado.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Azure Arc","Azure IoT Central","Azure IoT Hub","Azure Sphere"],"explanation":"Azure Sphere provee MCU + OS Linux seguro + servicio en la nube."},{"id":168,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure feature ensures high availability even if an entire datacenter fails?","question_es":"¿Qué característica de Azure garantiza alta disponibilidad incluso si un datacenter completo falla?","options":{"A":"Availability Sets","B":"Proximity Placement Groups","C":"Host Groups","D":"Availability Zones"},"options_es":{"A":"Availability Sets","B":"Proximity Placement Groups","C":"Host Groups","D":"Availability Zones"},"correct":["D"],"explanation":"Las Availability Zones son zonas físicas separadas que toleran fallas de datacenter."},{"id":169,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service restricts administrators to creating resources only in approved regions?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure restringe a los administradores a crear recursos solo en regiones aprobadas?","options":{"A":"A read-only lock","B":"Azure Policy","C":"Management Group","D":"A reservation"},"options_es":{"A":"Un bloqueo de solo lectura","B":"Azure Policy","C":"Un Management Group","D":"Una reserva"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Azure Policy aplica reglas como allowedLocations para bloquear regiones no aprobadas."},{"id":170,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Select the answer that correctly completes the sentence: An Azure region ____.","question_es":"Selecciona la respuesta que completa correctamente la frase: Una región de Azure ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"contains one or more datacenters that are connected by a low-latency network","statement_es":"contiene uno o más datacenters conectados por una red de baja latencia","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["contains one or more datacenters that are connected by a low-latency network","is found in every country","is located in each county where Microsoft has a subsidiary","is found in every country in Europe and the Americas"],"explanation":"Una región es un conjunto de datacenters físicos conectados por red de baja latencia."},{"id":171,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Which Azure portal blade should you use to view planned maintenance events that can affect your Azure subscription?","question_es":"¿Qué blade del portal de Azure debes usar para ver eventos de mantenimiento planificado que pueden afectar tu suscripción?","statements":[{"statement_en":"Service Health","statement_es":"Service Health","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Dashboard","All Resources","Monitor","Service Health","Subscriptions"],"explanation":"Solo Service Health muestra incidentes y mantenimiento planeado que afecta tus recursos."},{"id":173,"type":"single","question_en":"Does using management groups alone meet the goal of automating resource creation?","question_es":"¿Usar management groups por sí solo cumple el objetivo de automatizar la creación de recursos?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Los management groups solo organizan suscripciones. No crean recursos ni automatizan despliegues."},{"id":175,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service provides a platform for serverless code?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure proporciona una plataforma para código sin servidor?","options":{"A":"Azure Container Instances","B":"Azure Functions","C":"Azure Kubernetes Service","D":"Azure Virtual Machines"},"options_es":{"A":"Azure Container Instances","B":"Azure Functions","C":"Azure Kubernetes Service","D":"Azure Virtual Machines"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Azure Functions es la plataforma para código sin servidor."},{"id":176,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Identify which Azure blade is used for each task.","question_es":"Identifica qué blade de Azure se usa para cada tarea.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Monitor the health of Azure services","statement_es":"Monitorear el estado de los servicios de Azure","correct":"Service Health"},{"statement_en":"Browse available virtual machine images","statement_es":"Explorar imágenes disponibles de máquinas virtuales","correct":"Marketplace"},{"statement_en":"View security recommendations","statement_es":"Ver recomendaciones de seguridad","correct":"Advisor"}],"options":["Monitor","Marketplace","Service Health","Advisor","Subscriptions"],"explanation":"Cada blade del portal tiene funciones específicas: Advisor para seguridad, Marketplace para imágenes, Service Health para disponibilidad."},{"id":177,"type":"single","question_en":"Which serverless Azure service should you use to run automated email notifications?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio serverless de Azure debes usar para ejecutar notificaciones de correo automatizadas?","options":{"A":"Web App","B":"Marketplace image","C":"Logic App","D":"API App"},"options_es":{"A":"Aplicación Web","B":"Imagen de Marketplace","C":"Logic App","D":"API App"},"correct":["C"],"explanation":"Logic Apps es la opción recomendada para flujos automatizados e integraciones como envío de emails."},{"id":179,"type":"multi","question_en":"Which three options allow you to create an Azure VM from an Android tablet?","question_es":"¿Cuáles tres opciones te permiten crear una máquina virtual de Azure desde una tablet Android?","options":{"A":"Use Bash in Azure Cloud Shell","B":"Use PowerShell in Azure Cloud Shell","C":"Use the PowerApps portal","D":"Use the Security & Compliance admin center","E":"Use the Azure portal"},"options_es":{"A":"Usar Bash en Azure Cloud Shell","B":"Usar PowerShell en Azure Cloud Shell","C":"Usar el portal de PowerApps","D":"Usar el Security & Compliance admin center","E":"Usar el portal de Azure"},"correct":["A","B","E"],"explanation":"Cloud Shell y el Azure Portal funcionan desde cualquier navegador moderno, incluyendo Android."},{"id":180,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service minimizes administrative effort for deploying and removing 50 VMs weekly?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure minimiza el esfuerzo administrativo al implementar y eliminar 50 VMs semanalmente?","options":{"A":"Azure Reserved VM Instances","B":"Azure DevTest Labs","C":"Azure Virtual Machine Scale Sets","D":"Azure Virtual Desktop"},"options_es":{"A":"Instancias reservadas de VM","B":"Azure DevTest Labs","C":"Conjuntos de escalado de máquinas virtuales","D":"Escritorio Virtual de Azure"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"DevTest Labs permite automatizar creación y eliminación rápida de entornos, ideal para escenarios de testing masivo."},{"id":181,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"For each statement about Azure Advisor, select Yes or No.","question_es":"Para cada afirmación sobre Azure Advisor, selecciona Sí o No.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Azure Advisor provides recommendations on improving Azure AD security.","statement_es":"Azure Advisor proporciona recomendaciones para mejorar la seguridad de Azure AD.","correct":"No"},{"statement_en":"Azure Advisor provides recommendations to reduce the cost of running Azure VMs.","statement_es":"Azure Advisor proporciona recomendaciones para reducir el costo de ejecutar VMs de Azure.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Azure Advisor provides recommendations on configuring network settings for Azure VMs.","statement_es":"Azure Advisor proporciona recomendaciones para configurar ajustes de red en VMs de Azure.","correct":"Yes"}],"explanation":"Advisor no gestiona Azure AD; sí optimiza costos y configuración de recursos."},{"id":182,"type":"single","question_en":"Does running the command in Azure Cloud Shell using PowerShell meet the goal of deploying VM1?","question_es":"¿Cumple el objetivo ejecutar el comando en Azure Cloud Shell usando PowerShell para desplegar VM1?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Cloud Shell ejecuta comandos Azure CLI o PowerShell directamente en la suscripción seleccionada."},{"id":183,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to create VM1 in Subscription1 by using an Azure CLI command. Does installing Azure CLI on a Windows 10 computer, signing in from PowerShell, and running the command meet the goal?","question_es":"Necesitas crear VM1 en Subscription1 usando un comando de Azure CLI. ¿Cumple el objetivo instalar Azure CLI en Windows 10, iniciar sesión desde PowerShell y ejecutar el comando?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure CLI funciona en Windows 10 y puede ejecutarse desde PowerShell; esto permite crear la VM sin problemas."},{"id":184,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Identify which Azure management tools can be used from each computer.","question_es":"Identifica qué herramientas de administración de Azure pueden usarse desde cada computadora.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Computer1 (Windows 10): Azure CLI, Azure portal, and Azure PowerShell","statement_es":"Computer1 (Windows 10): Azure CLI, Azure portal y Azure PowerShell","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Computer2 (Ubuntu): Azure CLI and Azure portal","statement_es":"Computer2 (Ubuntu): Azure CLI y Azure portal","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Computer3 (macOS Mojave): Azure CLI and Azure portal","statement_es":"Computer3 (macOS Mojave): Azure CLI y Azure portal","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Azure CLI","Azure portal","Azure PowerShell"],"explanation":"Azure PowerShell no está disponible nativamente en Linux o macOS, pero CLI y el portal sí funcionan en todas las plataformas."},{"id":185,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Complete the sentence: You can access Compliance Manager from the ____.","question_es":"Completa la frase: Puedes acceder a Compliance Manager desde ____.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Microsoft Service Trust Portal","statement_es":"Microsoft Service Trust Portal","correct":"Yes"}],"options":["Azure Active Directory admin center","Azure portal","Microsoft 365 admin center","Microsoft Service Trust Portal"],"explanation":"Compliance Manager está disponible exclusivamente en el Microsoft Service Trust Portal."},{"id":186,"type":"hotspot","question_en":"Complete each sentence about Azure governance and deployment features.","question_es":"Completa cada oración sobre las características de gobernanza y despliegue de Azure.","statements":[{"statement_en":"Azure Resource Manager templates provide infrastructure as code for consistent deployments.","statement_es":"Las plantillas de Azure Resource Manager proporcionan infraestructura como código para despliegues consistentes.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Azure policies provide governance and enforcement of compliance across Azure resources.","statement_es":"Azure Policies proporcionan gobernanza y cumplimiento a través de los recursos de Azure.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Resource groups provide logical grouping of Azure resources.","statement_es":"Los grupos de recursos proporcionan agrupación lógica de los recursos de Azure.","correct":"Yes"},{"statement_en":"Management groups provide grouping and organization of Azure subscriptions.","statement_es":"Los management groups proporcionan la organización de suscripciones de Azure.","correct":"Yes"}],"options":[],"explanation":"ARM = IaC; Policies = gobernanza; Resource groups = agrupación lógica; Management groups = organización de suscripciones."},{"id":187,"type":"single","question_en":"Does deploying two virtual machines in a single Availability Zone meet a 99.99% availability requirement?","question_es":"¿Cumple una disponibilidad del 99.99% desplegar dos máquinas virtuales en una sola Availability Zone?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No","C":"It depends on the VM size","D":"It depends on the region"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No","C":"Depende del tamaño de la VM","D":"Depende de la región"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Para 99.99% necesitas VMs distribuidas en AZs distintas; una sola zona no garantiza ese SLA."},{"id":190,"type":"single","question_en":"Which Azure service provides a serverless computing environment, allowing you to run code without managing servers?","question_es":"¿Qué servicio de Azure proporciona un entorno serverless que permite ejecutar código sin administrar servidores?","options":{"A":"Azure Virtual Machines","B":"Azure Functions","C":"Azure Storage Account","D":"Azure Dedicated Hosts"},"options_es":{"A":"Máquinas virtuales de Azure","B":"Azure Functions","C":"Cuenta de almacenamiento de Azure","D":"Hosts dedicados de Azure"},"correct":["B"],"explanation":"Azure Functions es el servicio serverless basado en eventos."},{"id":192,"type":"single","question_en":"Does launching Azure Cloud Shell in Bash and running the 'az vm create' command meet the goal?","question_es":"¿Cumple el objetivo iniciar Azure Cloud Shell en Bash y ejecutar el comando 'az vm create'?","options":{"A":"Yes","B":"No"},"options_es":{"A":"Sí","B":"No"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Azure Cloud Shell con Bash incluye Azure CLI, por lo que permite crear la VM correctamente."},{"id":193,"type":"single","question_en":"You need to automate the creation of identical Azure resources for multiple business units. What should you recommend?","question_es":"Necesitas automatizar la creación de recursos idénticos en varias unidades de negocio. ¿Qué debes recomendar?","options":{"A":"Azure Resource Manager templates","B":"Virtual machine scale sets","C":"Azure API Management","D":"Management groups"},"options_es":{"A":"Plantillas de Azure Resource Manager","B":"Conjuntos de escalado de máquinas virtuales","C":"Azure API Management","D":"Management groups"},"correct":["A"],"explanation":"Las plantillas ARM permiten crear conjuntos idénticos de recursos de forma repetible y automatizada."}];
